<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHANA Yuk Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johan</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHANA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yuk Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Ahina <char style="bk">Johana Yuk Thangkdaw</char> üng Johan naw Jesuh cun khyanga kba law lü mi ksunga khyanga kba xüng lawki, angsäi xüngki Pamhnama Ngthu ni ti lü pyenkia kyaki. Jesuh cun Pamhnam naw bekhüt a jah peta mäiha jah küikyan khaia Pamhnama Capa ni tia ca khekie naw ami jumnak vaia yuka kyaki. Acunkäna ani jum nakütki cun naw angsäi xünnak yah khai, tia mawng pi a yuk hmuha kyaki (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Angsäia xüngki Pamhnama Ngthu Jesuha mawng akcüka a pyen käna, Jesuh cun jah küikyankia Bawipa, Pamhnama Capa tia ngdangsaki müncankseea mawng a yuk hmuha kyaki. Acunkäna a pyene cun müncanksee üng jah mtheh ngkhaiki. Khyang he naw Jesuh ami jum law ja a hnukläkea ami thawn law, ja khyang avang naw ani mah u lü am ami kcangnak hlüa mawng jah mthehki. Akyangkdäm 13-17 naw Jesuh ja axüisaw he, Jesuh ami man law vaia mü üng ami awmih, ngcüngceinaka ngthue, ami taih law vaia mü üng axüisaw he a jah mcuhmcäia mawnge cun mi jah hmuhki. Akpäihnaka kyange naw Jesuh ami man, ami kcükcet, ami hnimnak ja a thawhnak be, a thawh be käna axüisaw he veia a ngdang hünake jah mthehki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kpami am bäühma ni se ami mana nghnumia mawng cun (8:1-11) bracketa k’uma ami tak. Isenitiüng, avang naw yuksih u se, a na yuk makie avang naw ami hawihin.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Johan</char> naw Khritaw üngkhyüh yaha angsäia xünnak letsawng cun atuh hin cutei päng lü; Jesuh cun lam, ngthungtak ja xünnak ni ti lü doeiki naküta khana acuna letsawng cun a pha law vaia mawng aktunga yuki. Thangkdaw <char style="bk">Johana</char> hngalangnak ta; amhnüp tä mi jah hmuhtheh summange: tui, buh, akvai, toksäm ja a toe, capyit nghjung ja a ktheihe cun jah sumei lü ngmüimkhya lama a jah mtheimthangnakea kyaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptican Johan ja Jesuha axüisaw kcüke <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khyang hea ksunga Jesuha khut pawh <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng Jerusalema pipei ja Jerusalema k'um <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bawipa thawhnak be ja a ngdang hünak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnak: Kalilea a ngdangnak betü <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ngthu cun nghngicima ngtüi lawki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Akcük ma säiha Ngthu a na veki; Ngthu cun Mhnam am atänga veki, Ngthu cun Mhnama kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Ngthu cun akcük ma säih üngkhyüh Mhnam am a na veki. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Ahmäi naküt ani üngkhyüh Pamhnam naw a mhnüna kyaki; mhnünmceng naküt üng ani am ngpüikia mhnün i pi am ve. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ngthu cun xünnaka phungnua kyaki; acuna xünnak naw khyangea vei akvai lawpüiki. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Akvai cun anghmüpnaka vai law se, nghmüp naw am näng mkhüt.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:6">1:6</ref> </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mt 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Lk 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Pamhnam naw a ngsä mat a tüih law, a ngming cun Johana kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Ani naw khyangea veia akvaia mawng cun pyen se, khyange naw ngja u lü ami jumei law vai ua phäha kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Amät cun akvai am ni, akvaia mawng pyen khaia lawki. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Ani cun akvai kcang, khawmdek khana law lü khyang naküta khana vaiki.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Ngthu cun khawmdek khana veki, khawmdek cun ani üngkhyüh mhnünmcenga kyaki. Acunsepi khawmdek naw ani am ksing. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Amäta khyangea veia lawki. Acunsepi, amäta khyange naw am dokhamei u. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Acunsepi, avang naw doei lü jumei u se, Pamhnama caea thawn theinak a jah pet. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Acun he cun nghngicima mtisa thithaü üngkhyüh cawmbei lawkie am ni. Khyanga pasang üngka naw ngtüi lawkie pi am ni u, amimia pa ta Pamhnam ni.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Ngthu cun nghngicima ngtüi lawki; bäkhäknak ja ngthungtak am be lü mi ksunga veki. Paa ca mat däka hlüngtainaka kba, a hlüngtainak cun mi hmuhki.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Johan naw ania mawng a pyen ta, ‘Ka pyen khawi cen ani ni, “Ani cun ka hnua law kyaw sepi ka maa a na ve pängki ni” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Kümceikia ania bäkhäknak am dawkyanaka thea dawkyanak mi van naw mi yahki. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Thum cun Mosia kut üngkhyüh Pamhnam naw a jah peta kyaki. Acunsepi, bäkhäknak ja ngthungtak ta Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh a jah peta kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>U naw pi Pamhnam am hmuh khawi. Pamhnam am täng lü, Paa peia veki, a Capa mat däk naw paa mawng jah ksingsak pängki.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptican Johana ngthu pyen </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Jerusalema veki Judah ngvaie naw, “Nang u ni?” ti lü, kthäh acun hea ktaiyü he ja Levihe Johana veia ami jah tüih.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Johan naw käh mjih lü, “Kei Mesijah am ni ngü,” ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref> </char>
    </note>Amimi naw, “Nang u ni? Nang Elijah aw?” ti lü ami kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Johan naw, “Am ni ngü” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Nang Sahma aw?” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Johan naw, “Am ni ngü” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Amimi naw, “Acunüng nang u ni, jah mtheha? jah tüih lawkie kami jah mthehnak be vai ami ti. Namäta mawng hin ihawkba na pyenki ni?” ti lü ami kthäh betü u.<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Hesa 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Johan naw, “Sahma Hesajah naw a pyena mäiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Bawipaa lawnak vai lam ngsungsak u,’ ti lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">khawmkyanga ngpyangki kthaia ka kyaki ni,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Pharisee naw ami jah tüiha khyange cun naw, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>“Mesijah am ni, Elijah am ni, sahmaa pi am na ni üng, ise Baptican na jah peki ni?” ti u lü ami kthäh betü u.<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Johan naw, “Kei naw tui am Baptican ka jah pe khawiki, nami ksunga khyang mat am nami ksing ngdüiki. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Ani cun ka hnua law sepi, a khawdawk yüi suh pet khaia pi am nglawi ngü” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Ahin avan cun Johan naw baptican a jah petnaka hnün Jordan mliktui pei Bethaniha thawnhlawkia kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama Toca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Angawi üng Johan naw Jesuh a veia law se hmuh lü, “Khawmdeka mkhyekatnak cehpüiki Pamhnama Toca teng u! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Acan ni, ‘Keia kthaka dämduh bawki, ka hnua lawki kyaw, cunüngpi ka maa a na ve päng kungki ni,’ ka ti cen ani ni. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Akcüka ani am ksing ngü, cunsepi, Isarele naw ani ami ksing law vaia, kei naw law lü tui am Baptican ka jah peki,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Johan naw a mawng pyen lü, “Ngmüimkhya cun müma mäiha khankhaw üngka naw kyum law lü a khana ngawki ka hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>“Akcüka ta ani ni ti am ksing ngü. Cunsepi, tui am Baptican ka jah pe khaia na tüih lawki Pamhnam naw, ‘Ngmüimkhya a khana kyum law lü a ngawhnaka khyang na hmuh üng, ani cun Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am Baptican jah pe khaia Khyang ni’ ti lü a na mtheh. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Johan naw “Ani ka hmuh pängki, ani Pamhnama Capaa kyaki tia ka ning jah mthehki,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha xüisaw kcüke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Angawi betü üng, Johan naw axüisaw xawi nghngih am ngdüi lü, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Jesuh law se hmuh lü, “Acan ni Pamhnama Toca,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Axüisaw xawi naw a pyen ngja ni lü, Jesuh läki xawi. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Jesuh naw ani veia nghlat lü läk law ni se a jah hmuh üng, <char style="wj">“I nani suiki” </char>ti lü, a jah kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Anini naw, ‘Rabbi (Saja tinak), hawia na veki?” ani ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Law ni lü nani hmuh khai,” </char>a ti. Cit ni lü a venak ani hmuh, acuna mhnüp cun a hlawnga veeiki xawi; acun cun mülama (Naji kphyü bang) kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Johana ngthu pyen ngja ni lü, Jesuh läki nghngih üngka mat cun Sihmon Pita a na Andrua kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Andru naw akcüka a be Sihmon hmuh lü, “Mesijah hmuh ve ung” ti lü, a mtheh (Mesijah ti cun Khritaw tinak ni). <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Acunüng, Sihmon cun Jesuha veia a lawpüi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jesuh naw teng lü, <char style="wj">“Nang hin Johana capa Sihmon na ngmingnaki, Kephaa ning sui khaie,”</char> a ti (Acun cun Pita üng täng lü, “Lung” tinaka kyaki).<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philip ja Natanelah Jesuh naw a jah khünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Angawi üng Jesuh Kalile khawa cit khaia a ngtün üng, Philip hmuh lü, <char style="wj">“Na läk lawa”</char> a ti. (<verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Philip cun Bethsaida mlüha kaa kyaki, acun cun Andru ja Pitaa ani venaka mlüha kyaki.) <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Philip naw Natanelah hmuh lü, “Mosi naw ania mawng Thum üng a yuk, sahma he naw pi a mawng ami yuk, Nazaret üngka, Josepa capa Jesuh, kami hmuhkie” ti lü a mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanelah naw, “Nazaret mlüha cimvaiki ve khai aw?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Philip naw, “Law lü, teng lawa” a ti be.<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Jesuh naw, Natanelah a veia law se hmuh lü, <char style="wj">“A mkhyenak lang am vekia Isarel khyang kcang, teng ua”</char> ti lü, a pyen.<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanelah naw, “Nang naw ihawkba na na ksing ni?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Philip naw am a ning khü ham lü, Fikdung phunga na ve üng ka ning hmuh päng ni” </char>a ti be.<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanelah naw, “Rabbi, nang Pamhnama Capa ni, Isarelea Sangpuxanga pi kya veki,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Fikdung phunga na ve üng ka ning hmuh päng ni’ ka tia phäha na na kcangnaki aw? Ahina kthaka dämduh bawki na hmuh law khai,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Gen 28:12</ref></char></note>Jesuh bä naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki. Tuha khankhaw nghmawng lü Pamhnama khankhawngsäe Khyanga Capaa khana ju kyum jeng kai u se nami jah hmuh law khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kana mlüha cambumnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Amhnüp nghngih käna Kalile hne, Kana mlüha cambumnak veki. Acuia Jesuha nu pi veki. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Jesuh ja axüisaw he pi acuia ami jah khüei hnga. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Capyitui päih se Jesuha nu naw, “Capyitui päih ve,” ti lü Jesuh üng a mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“I pawh vai ti cun, nanga na mtheh vai am hlü. Ka kcün am pha ham,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>A nu naw mpyae üng, “A ning jah mtheh naküt pawh ua,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Judahea thuma ngcimcaihnak vaia, kalan mku ja thumkipa keh vangkia mcü khyuk veki. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Jesuh naw mpyae üng, <char style="wj">“Mcüe tui am jah kbe päih ua,”</char> a ti. Be lü pyep khaia tui ami jah than. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tukbäih tui avang lo u lü pawi tuiktänga veia cehpüi ua,”</char> a ti. Mpyae naw tuiktänga veia ami cehpüi.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Pawi tuiktäng naw tui cun Capyittuia ngläüh lawki cun mdep lü, angtüi lawnak am ksing, (Tui thanki mpyae naw ta ksingki he). Acunüng cambumki khü lü, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>“Khyang naküt naw akcüka Capyittui asü am jah khin na ma lü, ami awk phü käna va akpaih am jah khin na khawikie. Nang naw ta tuh vei cäpa asü am jah khin na veki,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Jesuh naw hina müncankse akcük säih Kalile hne, Kana mlüha mdang lü a hlüngtainak mdangki. Acunüng, axüisaw he naw Jesuh jumkie.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mt 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunkäna a nu, a nae ja axüisaw he am, Kapenawm mlüha cit u lü acuia khawmhnüp asäng awmkie.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Templea citki </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mt 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Lk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ex 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Judahea Lätnak Pawi kcün pha law se, Jesuh Jerusalema jeng citki. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Temple k'uma, se mna, to, müme jah jawikie ja, ngui mhlaikia khyange a jah hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Kpaihnak vaia yüipawk pawh lü, Temple üngka naw se mna ja toe a jah sät. Ngui mhlaikiea ami ngawhnake jah ktukhawngin lü nguikcange a jah hukxänin pet. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Müm jawikiea üng, <char style="wj">“Hine akcea jah cehpüi ua, ka Paa im jawihtuknaka käh pyang ua,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Sal 69:9</ref></char></note>Axüisawe naw, “Na ima phäha ka ngaihngtühnak naw ka mlung k'uma na uiawng ve,” ti lü, ng’yuki ami süm law be.<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Judah ngvaie naw ngthäh u lü, “Ahikba na jah pawhki. Na cangki tia a ngsingnak vaia, ia müncankse na jah mhnuh khai ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mt 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Hina Temple kpye uki se, mhnüp kthum üng ka mdüih be khai,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Judahe naw, “Hina Temple kum kphyükip ja khyuk so khaia sak ni. Ihawkba nang naw mhnüp kthum üng na mdüih be khawh khai ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Cunüngpi Jesuh naw Temple a ti cun amäta pumsa a pyenaka kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Acunakyase, Jesuh thihnak üngka naw a thawh law käna, axüisaw he naw ami veia a pyen khawi süm law bekie. Acunüng cangcim ja ngthu Jesuh naw a pyen cun jumkie.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyanga ngneiksak Jesuh naw a ksing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Jesuh Jerusalem mlüh Lätnak Pawi buh pawhnaka ve se, müncanksee a jah pawh hmuh u lü, khyang khawhah naw ani jumkie. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Acunsepi, Jesuh naw khyang naküt jah ksingkia kyase, khyangea veia amät naw amät am ng’apei. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Khyanga mlung k'uma i veki ti cun ksingkia kyase, khyangea mawng ani üng u naw i a mtheh vai am hlü.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Nikawdim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Pharise üngka khyang mat Nikawdim ngming naki, Judahea mkhawng veki.<verse eid="JHN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Ani cun mthana Jesuha veia law lü, “Rabbi, nang Pamhnama vei üngka naw lawkia saja, ti kami ksingki. Isetiakyaküng, müncanksee na jah pawha mäih, Pamhnam am ngpüikia u naw am jah pawh khawh,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning mthehki, am hmi bekia khyang naw Pamhnama Khaw am hmu thei,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikawdim naw, “Ihawkba khyang axü käna hmi be thei khai ni? A nua pum k'uma lut be lü anghngihnak hmi law be thei khai aw?” ti lü a kthäh be.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning mthehki, tui ja Ngmüimkhya üng am hmi bekia khyang Pamhnama Khawa am lut thei.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/><char style="wj">Nghngicim üng hmi lawki cun nghngicim khyanga kya lü, Ngmüimkhya üng hmiki cun ngmüimkhya khyanga kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/><char style="wj">‘Na hmi be vai ka tia phäha käh cäia.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/><char style="wj">Khawkhi a ngaihnak da khiki. A khi kthai na ngja kyawki, lüpi hawia khyüh law lü, haw da citki ti am ksingki. Au pi Ngmüimkhya üng hmiki cun acukba ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikawdim naw msang lü, “Ihawkba acukba thawn thei khai ni?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nang cun Isarele khyangmjü üng saja kyäpa pi kya lü, ahin am na ksingki aw?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning mthehki, kami ksing ning jah mtheh lü, kami hmuh kami ning jah mhnuh khawiki. Acunüng mat naw pi kami pyen am doei uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdeka mawng ka ning jah mtheh üng am nami na kcangnak üng ta, khankhawa mawng ka ning jah mtheh üng ihawkba nami na kcangnak khai ni?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/><char style="wj">“Khana khyüh kyum lawki Khyanga Capaa thea, u khana am kai khawi.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:9">Num 21:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Mosi naw khawmkyanga tangka am pyang kphyu lup a taiha mäiha, Khyanga Capa pi taiha kya khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/><char style="wj">“Au pi Ani jumki naküt naw angsäi xünnak yah khaie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnam naw khawmdek a mhläkphyanak leng lenga phäh a Capa mat däk a jah pet. Ani jumki naküt cun käh thi ti lü angsäia xünnak yah khaie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnam naw a Capa, khawmdeka a tüih law cun ngthumkhyah khaia a tüih law am ni. Khawmdek küikyan Bawi vaia a tüih law ni.</char><verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“A Capa jumki cun ngthumkhyahnak am khamei. Acunsepi, Ania ngming am jumki cun Pamhnam Capa mat däk am a jumeia phäha, ngthumkhyahnak khamei pängkia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/><char style="wj">“Hin hin, ngthumkhyahnaka kyaki. Pamhnama akvai khawmdek khana lawki, acunsepi nghngicime naw ami bilawh am a dawa phäha, akvaia kthaka nghmüp jawng na bawkie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, am dawki bilokie naw akvai cun hnengkie, ami bilawh angdang vai kyüh u lü akvaia veia am law u.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, akcang bilokie naw Pamhnama mtheh ami ngjaka mawngma akvai naw mdan khaia, akvai da law khawikie,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Baptican Johan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Acunkäna, Jesuh ja axüisaw he cun acuia ve u lü khyange am baptican a jah petnak khawia hnün Judah khaw ngnamea citkie. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Johan naw Salim pei Anon, acuia tui a daa phäha, baptican a jah pe k’um üng, law u lü Baptican khan lawkie. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mt 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Lk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Johan thawngim üng am khyum ham u.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Acuia Johana xüisawe avang ja Judahea nglak üng, khawning ngcimcaihnaka mawng ngcuhnak ve lawki. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Johana veia law u lü, “Saja aw, tenga, Jordan mliktuia nghngilawa na hlawnga veki, a mawng na pyen naw Baptican jah pe se, khyang ami van a veia cit ve u,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Johan naw jah msang lü, “Au naw pi, khana khyüh am pet üng ta i am yah khawh. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref></char></note> ‘Kei Mesijah am ni, acunsepi, kei cun ania maa tüih lawa ka kyaki ni’ ka ti cen nangmi hin ka ning jah saksie ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>“Cambumkia cangpyang üng va cangla cun sängeiki. Cunsepi cangpyanga peia ngdüi lü cangpyanga kthai ngjaki a nglawipüi cun naw cangpyanga kthai a ngjak üng jekyaiki. Acukba ni ka jenak akümbe. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>“Ani hlüngtai law dämdäm se, kei ka ju nem phätphät khai.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khan üngkhyüh kyum lawki Jesuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>“Khan üngkhyüh lawki cun avana kthaka dämduh bawki ni. Mce üngka cun mce üng sängei lü khawmdeka mawngma va pyetksaki. Cunüngpi, Khankhaw üngkhyüh lawki cun anaküta khana dämduh bawki ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>“A hmuh ja a ngjak jah mtheh kyaw sepi, a pyen u naw pi am dokhamei u. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>“Au pi, a pyen dokhamki cun Pamhnam cangki tia mdangki ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>“Pamhnama tüih lawa khyang cun naw Mhnama ngthu pyenki. Isetiakyaküng, Pamhnam naw ani üng kümceikia a Ngmüimkhya a peta phäha kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mt 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Lk 10:22</ref></char></note>“Pa naw a Capa mhläkphya na lü, ahmäi naküt a kut üng a msum. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>“Au pi, a Capa jumki naw anglät xünnak yahki; au pi a Capa am jumki naküt naw xünnak am yah. Pamhnama mkhuimkhanaka kea ve khaie,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Samarih nghnumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Jesuh naw Johana kthaka Baptican jah pe lü, axüisaw hea jah pyangki tia mawng, Pharisee naw ngjakie. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>(Akcanga ta, Jesuh amät naw baptican am jah pe, axüisaw he naw ami jah peta kyaki), <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Ami pyena mawng Jesuh naw a ngjak ja Judah khaw ceh ta lü, Kalile khaw da, <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Samarih khaw sunpah lü cit yahki.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 33:19">Gen 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref></char>
    </note>Jakop naw a capa Josep üng a peta khaw pei, Samarih khaw hne Sukhar mlüha pha lawki. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Acuia Jakopa tuikhui veki. Jesuh lam a lawnak bawngbai lü, tuikhui peia ngawki. Acun cun mhnüp ngsunga kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Samarih nghnumi tui than khaia law se Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka awk vai tui na pea,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>(Acun k'um üng, axüisaw he cun mlüh k’uma ei vai khyäi acun hea citkie.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Eza 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 4:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Samarih nghnumi naw, “Ihawkba, nang Judah khyang naw, kei Samarih nghnumia veia tui na awk vai na täeiki ni?” ti lü, a kthäh be. (Judah khyang mjüe cun Samarih khyangea eiawknak tuikhawt üng eiawk am thum na u.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pamhnam naw nang üng i ning pet hlüki ti am ksingki, u naw tui ning täeiki ti pi am ksingki. Na ksinga ta, angsäia xünnak tui ning pet vaia na na täei khai sü,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Nghnumi naw, “Saja aw, tuikhui thuki, vähnak vai tuipung pi am na taki. Hawia kaa xünnak tui na taki ni? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>“Hina tuikhui, amät naw aw khawi lü, a cae ja, a khyüngseie naw pi ami awk khawi, kami pu Jakop naw a jah pet, nang ania kthaka kyäp bawk aih lü,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Hina tui awki naküt ta, tui cawi be ham khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/><char style="wj">Acunsepi, kei naw ka pet vaia tui awki naküt ta, tui am cawi ti. Kei naw ka pet vaia tui cun a puk k'uma hna lü, angsäi xünnak tuia kya se, anglät xünnak pi yah khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Nghnumi naw, “Saja aw, tui am cawi ti lü, tui than khaia hia käh ka law be ti vaia, acuna tui na pea,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cita, na cei va khü lü, law bea,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Nghnumi naw, “Ka cei am ve,” ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka cei am ve na ti cang veki,</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/><char style="wj">Na cei mhma ve pängki, tuh na vepüi pi na ceia am kya; acen üng akcang pyen veki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Nghnumi naw, “Saja aw, sahma mata na kya khaia ning ksing veng. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>“Kami pupae naw hina mcung üng Pamhnam a na hjawkhah khawikie. Nangmi Judahe naw, ‘Jerusalema ni Pamhnam hjawkhahnak’ nami tiki” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nghnumi aw, ka pyen hin juma. Khyang he naw Pa cun ahina mcung ja Jerusalem mlüha am ami hjawkhahnak tia kcün pha law khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi Samarihe naw nami hjawkhah am ksing uki. Cunüngpi, keimi Judahe naw ta u kami hjawkhahki ti kami ksingki. Isetiakyaküng, küikyannak cun Judahe üngka naw lawkia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, akcün pha law khai, hjawkhahkie naw Ngmüimkhya ja akcanga ami hjawkhah vai cun tukbäih yea kya ve. Pa naw acukba hjawkhah khaie jah hlüeiki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/><char style="wj">“Mhnam cun Ngmüimkhyaa kyaki. Hjawkhahki naküt naw Ngmüimkhya ja ngthungtak am hjawkhah yah vai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Nghnumi naw, “Mesijah law khai ti ka ksingki. Ani a law üng, ani naw ahmäi naküt jah mtheh law khai,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nang ning ngthuheipüiki hin ani ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Acunüng axüisaw he law bekie naw nghnumi am a na ngthuhei se hmuh u lü müncankie. Acunsepi, u naw pi, “I na ngaihki? Ise hina nghnumi na ngthuheipüiki ni?” ti lü, am kthäh u.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Nghnumi naw a tui um hawih hüt lü, a lawnak khaw da citki naw khyange üng jah mtheh lü, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Law ua, ka awmih khawi naküt ksingkia khyang mat ve ve, teng law u. Mesijah am niki aw?” a ti. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Mlüh ceh ta u lü, Jesuha veia citkie.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Acun k'um üng axüisaw he naw, “Rabbi, na ei eia” ti lü, ami mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Acunsepi Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi naw am nami ksing ka ei vai ta veng,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Axüisawe amimät üng, “A ei vai tha lawki veki aw” ti lü, ngthähkie.<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na tüih lawkia a ngjak hlü bilawh ja, a khut kpäng vai cun keia eiawka kyaki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/><char style="wj">“‘Khya kphyü ve hamki, acun käna cang ahnaka kcün pha law khai’ am nami ti khawiki aw? Teng u, ka ning jah mthehki, mang hü u lü, loe jah teng süm ua, hmin päng lü, ah vai kcün ve u.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/><char style="wj">“Atki naw ngkhyengnak yah lü anglät xünnak vaia a ktheipai mcun ve, sawki ja atki ani nghngih atänga je yüm khai xawi. </char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/><char style="wj">“Ahin üng, ‘mat naw saw se, mat naw atki’ tia khuisui cun cang ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/><char style="wj">“Am nami khüinak khawia loa cang at khaia ka ning jah tüihki. Acuia akce he naw khüi u se, ami khüinak kce cun nangmia ngmangnak ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Acunüng, “Ka awmih naküt ksingki ve ve,” tia, ngthu, nghnumi naw a pyena phäha Samarih khyang khawhah naw Jesuh jum lawkie. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Samarih khyange Jesuh veia ami law üng ami veia a ve vaia nghui na u se, acuia Jesuh cun mhnüp nghngih awmki.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Jesuh a ngthu pyena phäh khyang khawkän naw jum lawkie. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Acunakyase, nghnumia veia, “Tuh ta, nanga pyena phäha am kya lü, kamimät naw kami ngjak ja akcanga hin hin khawmdeka Küikyan Bawia kyaki ti, kami ksinga phäha kami jumki,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Acawjah ngvaia ca a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Amhnüp nghngih käna, acun üngka naw Kalile hne da citki. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mt 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mk 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Lk 4:24</ref></char></note>Isetiakyaküng, Jesuh amät naw, “Sahma cun amäta hminaka khawa mhlünmtainak am yah khawi naw,” a ti. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char></note>Jerusalem Lätnak Pawia cit u lü Pawi k’um üng Jesuh naw a jah pawhmsah naküt jah hmukie naw ta, Kalile khawa Jesuh a law üng, Kalile khyange naw dokhamkie.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Jn 2:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun käna Jesuh Kalile khaw Kana, tui cun capyituia a nglatnak sak hnüna law beki. Acuia khyang ngvai mat a capa Kapenawm mlüha a mhnatei veki. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Ani naw Jesuh Judah khaw üngka naw Kalile khawa lawki ti a ngjak üng, a capa thih law hlüki, law lü a mdaw law be vaia cit lü a va nghuinak. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U naw pi müncanksee ja cäiletnake am nami hmuh üng amdanga am jum hlü uki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Khyang ngvai naw, “Saja aw, ka ca am a thih ham üng akjanga lawa,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Cit bea, na capa daw be khai ni,”</char> a ti. Khyang ngvai cun Jesuha pyen jum lü nghlat beki. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>A nghlat be lama a mpyae naw a na khyum u lü, “Na capa dawei law be ve,” ti lü, ami mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Ngvai naw iti üng a capa a daw law bea mawng jah kthäh se, amimi naw, “Müta, mü lam naji mat üng mhnat naw khyah ve,” ti lü, ami mtheh. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na capa daw be khai ni,”</char> a tinaka kcüna kyaki ti a ksing. Acunakyase, amät ja a khuiim kyawnglawng ami van naw jumkie.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Ahin cun Jesuh Judah khaw üngka naw Kalile khawa a law käna anghngihnak müncankse a pawha kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw Bethzatha tuilia khyang a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Acunkäna Judahea pawi mat ve se, Jesuh Jerusalema citki. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Jerusalem mlüh, To Mkawt peia Hebru läk am Bethzatha ami ti luhnak mhma lawki tui büm mat veki. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Am phetkia khyang khawhah, amikmü, akhawkxo, ja a kut khaw thikie ngjän u lü, tuia a ngsün law vai mtäteikie. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Isetiakyaküng, Bawipaa khankhawngsä, akcün kcün üng tui büm üng kyum law lü, tui a ksün ksün law. Acunüng, au pi, tuia ngsün päng ja tuia khana kco maki cun a natnak naküt daw be khawiki. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Khyang mat kum thumkip ja khyet kunki veki. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Jesuh naw acukba khawvei ve päng lü ngjänki ti ksing lü a hmuh üng, <char style="wj">“Na daw be vai na ngja hlüki aw?”</char> ti lü, a kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Ani naw, “Saja aw, tuia ngsün law üng tui büm da na kaih khai u am ve. Ka law k’um üng akce he naw na khe u lü kcoei ma thakthakie,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tho law, na ngjänak lo lü cita,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Angxita ani cun daw beki. A ngjänak lo lü citki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Acuna mhnüp cun Sabbath mhnüpa kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char></note>Judah ngvaie naw daw bekia veia, “Tuhngawi Sabbath mhnüpa kyaki. Judah Thuma tuhngawi na ngjännak käh na kawh hü vai,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Ani naw jah msang lü, “Na mdaw beki naw, <char style="wj">‘Na ngjännak lo lü cita’</char> a ti ni, ti lü a jah mtheh be.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Amimi naw, “Na ngjännak lo lü cita tiki u ni?” ti lü, ami kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Acunsepi, Jesuh khyangea ksunga khyükei se, ani mdaw bekia Jesuh cun u hmana am ksing.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Acun käna, Jesuh naw acuna khyang cun Temple a k'uma hmu be lü, <char style="wj">“Tenga, na daw be pängki. Käh mkhyekat be ti kawpi; am ani üng ta, ahina ksetam bawk lü na khana pha law khai ni,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Daw bekia khyang cun cit lü, ani mdaw beki cun Jesuh ni ti lü Judah ngvaie üng a jah mtheh. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Acukba sabbath mhnüp üng a bilawha phäha Judah ngvaie naw Jesuh mkhuimkhakie. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Ka Pa aläa khüikia kyase, kei pi ka khüiki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Jesuh Sabbath käh jeih lü, Mhnam pi amäta Pa ni tia a pyen ja, amät Mhnam am tängkia a pyena phäha, Judah ngvaie naw hnim law hlü bawkbawkie.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Capaa Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, Capa amät naw i am pawh thei. Acunsepi, Pa naw a pawh hmu lü pawhki. Pa naw a pawh naküt cun Capa naw pi acukba pawhki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/><char style="wj">“Pa naw Capa mhläkphya na lü, ahmäi amäta pawh naküt mhnuhki. Nami müncan vaia Pa naw Capa üng ahina kthaka däm bawkie jah mdang law khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/><char style="wj">Pa naw akthie jah mtho be lü, xünnak a jah peta mäiha, akcanga Capa naw pi a hlüeia khyang üng xünnak pe khai. </char> <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/><char style="wj">Pa naw ua lei am mtai, acunsepi, ngthumkhyahnak avan Capa üng a pet päng. </char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/><char style="wj">“Acun cun, Pa ami leisawnga mäiha khyang naküt naw Capa pi leisawng law khaie. Capa am leisawngki cun ani tüih lawki Pa am leisawngkia kyaki.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akcanga, ka ning jah mthehki, ka ngthu ngai lü na tüih lawki jumki naw angsäi xünnak yahki. Ngthumkhyahnak käh khamei khai, thihnak üngka naw xünnak pha pängki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki, thi pängki he naw Pamhnama Capa a ngkhü kthai ngja acun he. Ngjakia khyang naküt a xüng be vaia kcün pha law khai, akcanga ta pha law pängki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/><char style="wj">“Pa amät cun xünnaka phung ania mäiha, Pa naw Capa pi xünnaka phunga kyasaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/><char style="wj">Acunüng, ngthumkhyahnak vaia ana pi a pet ni. Isetiakyaküng, ani cun Khyanga Capa ania phäha kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/><char style="wj">“Ahina phäha käh müncan ua, lungdüa awmki he naküt naw Capa kthai ami ngjaknak vaia kcün pha law khai,</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">akdaw bilokie tho be u lü xünnak yah u se, akse bilokie tho be u lü mkatnak khamei khaie.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha mawng saksinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kamät naw i am pawh thei nawng. Ka ngjaka mäiha lei ka mtaiki; ka ngthumkhyah ngkhaiki. Isetiakyaküng, kamäta ngjak hlü käh sui lü, Pa na tüih lawkia ngjak hlü ka suia phäha kyaki.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kamäta mawngma ka saksi üng ka saksi cangki ti mdangnak vai am ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/><char style="wj">“Ka mawng saksiki akce veki; ani naw ka mawng a saksi cangki ti ka ksingki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Jn 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Johana veia ngsä tüih uki se, ani naw ngthungtak saksi khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/><char style="wj">“Khyang he naw ka mawng ihawkba ami saksi üng kei am ngtungjin nawng. Acunsepi nangmi küikyannak nami yah vaia phäh hin ka pyena kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/><char style="wj">“Johan cun däi lü vaikia meiim mat am tängki. Ania kvai asäng nami jenak vaia nami ngja hlükie. </char> <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/><char style="wj">“Kei naw Johana saksia kthaka dawki saksi ka taki. Isetiakyaküng, Pa naw a na peta khut ka biki. Ka bia khut naw Pa naw a na tüih law ti cun mdanki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunüng, na tüih lawkia Pa naw pi keia mawng na saksi petki. Iti üngpi a kthai ngja lü a hmai am hmu khawi uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/><char style="wj">A tüih law am nami jumeia phäh, Pamhnama ngthu pyen pi nami mlunga am kenei uki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/><char style="wj">“Cangcima k'uma angsäia xünnak nami hmu khaia ngai u lü, cangcim nami khe khawi jaiki. Acuna cangcim cun keia mawng saksikia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, xünnak nami yah khaia ka veia am law hlü uki.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khyanga mhlünmtainak am sui nawng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/><char style="wj">Cunsepi, nangmi cun ia khyang mjü ti ka ksingki. Pamhnam nami mlungmthin kcang üng am nami mhläkphyanak pi ka ksingki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/><char style="wj">“Ka pa a ngming üng law ngü se, am na dokham uki. Amäta ngming üng lawki khyang ani vai sü ta nami dokham khaie sü.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnam mat däka vei üngka naw lawkia hlüngtainak käh sui u lü, namimät üngka hlüngtainak nami hlawheikie naw kei ihawkba nami na jum thei khai ni?</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/><char style="wj">Kei naw, Paa veia ka ning jah khya khaia käh ngai u. Nami üpnak Mosi naw va ning jah khya khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/><char style="wj">“Mosi nami jum üng kei nami na jum khai. Isetiüng, ani naw keia mawng va yuk hütki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/><char style="wj">“Cunsepi, ania yuk am nami jum üng, ihawkba keia pyen nami jum khai?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw khyang thawngmhma a jah mbei </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Acunkäna, Jesuh Kalile Tuili, Tiberi Tuili pi ngmingnaki, a caye kama citki. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Am phetkie a jah mdaw bea müncanksee hmukie khyangpänu naw läk hükie. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Jesuh mcunga kai lü acuia axüisaw he am ngaw yümkie. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Judahea Lätnak Pawi cun cäh law betüki. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Jesuh naw mang hü lü khyang aktäkpai a veia lawkie a jah hmuh. Philip üng, <char style="wj">“Hinea ei khyawh vai, hawia mi khei khai ni?”</char> ti lü a kthäh. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>(I pawh vai cun a ksing päng kyaw, Philip a mhnütnaka a pyena kyaki.)<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Philip naw, “Nguikcang phyanghngih am kheih muk ta, hine naw apica cim ei u sepi am khäk khai ni,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Axüisaw üngka mat, Sihmon Pitaa na Andru naw, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Hia kpamica hnasen mat naw kyung muk mhma ja ngaca nghngih taki ve ve. Acunüng pi khyang hikäna phäh am khäk hlü ve?” ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Jah ngawhsak ua,”</char> a ti. (Acuna hnün cun msai aktäa sahki.) Khyang avan ngawkie, kpami däk thawngmhma lawkie. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Jesuh naw muk lo lü, Pamhnama veia jenak mthehki. Acun käna axüisaw he üng jah pe se, amimi naw ngawhkie üng ami jah pet. Acukba bäa nga pi ami ngaih kän käna ami jah pet u. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Ami phü käna Jesuh naw, axüisaw he üng, <char style="wj">“Apica pi käh bawkya khaia akhläi jah mkhäm be ua,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Muk nglung mhma cim ami eia khläi mkhäm be u se, cä xaleinghngih üng beki.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Acun üng Jesuha pawh müncankse hmukia khyange naw, “Akcanga hin hin, khawmdek khana law khaia Sahma kcang ni,” ami ti. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Khyang he naw man lü asihlinga ami sangpuxanga mcawn hlükie ti Jesuh naw ksingki. Acunakyase, mcunga amät kaiki.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh tui khana citki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mt 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Khaw mü law se axüisaw he tuili da ju citkie. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Mlawng üng kai lü, tuilia a caye Kapenawm mlüha citkie. Khaw nghmüp law sepi, Jesuh ami veia am pha law ham. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Khaw aknuia khi law se, tui ngnawk law lü kyan law dämdämki. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Mäng kthum kphyü bang tui vak u lü ami pha käna, Jesuh tuia khana law lü mlawng da cäh law se ami hmu üng kyüeikie. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei ni; käh na kyüei ua,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Mlawng üng Jesuh a na do law u se, angxita ami cehnak vaia kawng mlawng am va phakie.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang he naw Jesuh suikie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Angawi üng, tuili caye kawnga vekia khyange naw mlawng mat däk va veki ti ksing lawkie. Jesuh pi mlawng üng axüisaw hea hlawnga am ve se, axüisaw he amimät mlawng üng citei u se, ami jah hmu. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Tiberi mlüh üngkhyüh Mlawng akce he cun, Bawipa naw Pamhnam üng jenak a mtheh käna muk ami einaka peia lawkie. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Khyang he naw Jesuh ja axüisaw he acuia am ve u se ami jah hmu üng, amimät mlawnge üng kai u lü, Kapenawm mlüha Jesuh sui khaia citkie.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh xünnaka muk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Khyang he naw tuili cayea Jesuh a ve hmu u lü, “Rabbi, iti üng ahia na lawki ni?” ti lü, ami kthäh u.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: müncanksee nami hmuha phäha nami na suikia am kya, muk ei lü nami phüa phäh nami na suikie ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/><char style="wj">“Pyüpye theikia ei käh ktha na u. Khyanga Capa naw a ning jah pet vaia ei, angsäi xünnak ktha na u. Isetiakyaküng, Pa Pamhnam naw amäta msingnak cun Jesuha khana a tak ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Amimi naw, “Pamhnama mlung hlü kami pawhnak vaia, i kami pawh üng daw khai ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“A tüih lawa khyang nami jumei cun Pamhnama mlung hlü nami pawhkia kyaki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Amimi naw, “Hmu lü kami ning jumnak law vaia, ia müncankse ja na bi kawm? I ja na pawh kawm? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Ex 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Sal 78:24</ref></char></note> ‘Amimi naw muk ami ei vai khana khyüh jah peki’ ti lü, ami yuka mäiha, kami pupae naw manah khawmkyanga eikie,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: khana ka muk cen Mosia ning jah pet am ni. Khankhawa ka muk kcang ning jah peki ta keia Pa ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnama ning jah pet muk cun naw khankhaw üngkhyüh kyum law lü, khawmdek üng xünnak peki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Amimi naw, “Bawipa aw, acuna muk aläa jah pea,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei cun xünnak muka ka kyaki. Ka veia lawki naküt naw ei am cawi be ti; kei na jumki naküt naw tui am xai be ti,” ti lü a jah mtheh.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/><char style="wj">Nangmi naw nami na hmuha kpheia am na jumei uki, ti ka ning jah mthehki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/><char style="wj">“Ka Pa naw a na pet naküt ka veia law khaie. Ka veia lawki naküt kei naw am jah nghei ta ngü.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, kamäta ngjak hlü ka pawh khaia khana khyüh ka kyum lawki am ni. Na tüih lawkia a ngjak hlü ka pawh khaia ka lawki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/><char style="wj">“Na tüih lawkia a ngjak hlü cun a na pete u pi käh jah mkhyüh lü, akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng avan ka jah xünsak be khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/><char style="wj">“Ka paa ngjak hlü cun Capa hmu lü jumki naküt naw angsäi xünnak a yahnak vai ja, kei naw akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng ka jah xünsak be khaia kyaki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei khana khyüh ka kyum lawkia muk ni,”</char> a tia phäha Judahe naw aktäa am ngja hlü u. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>“Hin hin Jesuh, Josepa capa; a pa ja a nu pi mi jah ksing am niki aw? Ihawkba, <char style="wj">‘Kei khana khyüh ka kyum lawki’</char> a ti ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Namimät naw käh ngcuh ti ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/><char style="wj">“Na tüih lawkia Pa naw lam am a msüm üng, u ka veia am law thei khai ni. Akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng ka jah xünsak be khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Hesa 54:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘‘Ami van Pamhnam naw jah mthei khai’ ti lü, sahma he naw ami yuka mäiha, Ka Paa mtheh ngja lü ngtheingthangki naküt ka veia lawki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnama veia ka däka thea, u naw Pa am hmu khawi; Ani däk naw ni a hmuh.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: kei na jumki naw angsäi xünnak yahki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/><char style="wj">“Kei cun xünnak muka ka kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/><char style="wj">“Nami pupae naw khawkhyawng khawa manah ei kyaw u lü pi, amimi cun thikie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/><char style="wj">“Cunüngpi khankhaw üngkhyüh kyum lawki hina muk ei nakütki naw thihnak am hmu ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/><char style="wj">“Kei cun khana khyüh kyum lawkia xünnaka muk ni. Acuna muk eiki cun angsäia xüng khai. Khawmdeka xünnak vaia ka ning jah pet vaia muk ta ka mtisa hin ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Judahe amimät thüi lü ngcuh u lü, “Hina khyang naw ihawkba a mtisa ei vaia jah pe hlü theiki ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: Khyanga Capa a mtisa am ei lü, a thisen am awkia khyang naw xünnak am yah. </char> <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/><char style="wj">“Ka mtisa ei lü, ka thi awki naküt naw angsäi xünnak yah khai. Akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng ka jah mtho be khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, ka mtisa cun ei vai kcanga kya lü, ka thisen pi awk vai kcanga kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/><char style="wj">“Ka mtisa ei lü, ka thisen awki cun kei üng xüng se, kei pi ani üng ka xüng khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/><char style="wj">“Xüngseikia Pa naw na tüih law lü ania phäh kei ka xüngseia kba, ka mtisa eiki naküt cun keia phäh üng xüng khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/><char style="wj">“Hin ni khana khyüh kyum lawki xünnaka muk ta. Nami pupae naw ei u lü akäna ami thihnaka mäih am ni. Ahin eikia khyang naküt cun angsäia xüng khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Ahin Jesuh naw, Kapenawm mlüh, sinakoka k'uma a jah mthei üng a pyena kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Angsäi xünnaka ngthu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Axüisawe khawhah naw ahin ami ngjak üng, “Hina mtheinak akhak hin u naw ksing khawh khai ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>U naw am mtheh xa se, axüisaw he naw a pyen küisakie ti Jesuh naw a ksing üng, <char style="wj">“Hina phäha nami mlung seki aw?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/><char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa asüa a venaka kai be se nami hmu vai sü ta, ikba nami ti khai sü aw?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/><char style="wj">“Xünnak peki cun Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya ni. Khyanga khyaihnak naw i am khyaih khawh. Ka ning jah mtheha ngthue naküt hin naw Mhnam üngkhyüh sak xünnak ning jah peki Ngmüimkhya law püiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, nangmi üng akhäk naw am na jum hlü uki,”</char> a ti. (Akcük üngkhyüh Jesuh naw am jumkie, ja phyaheikia khyang a ksing pänga kyaki) <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Jesuh bä naw, <char style="wj">“Pa naw am a lawpüia khyang cun ka veia am law thei. Acunakyase, ahin he ka ning jah mthehki ni’</char> ka ti,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Acunüng axüisaw he khawhah naw ceh ta u lü, am läk ti u. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Jesuh naw, axüisaw he xaleinghngiha veia, <char style="wj">“Nangmi naw pi nami na ceh ta hlüki aw?”</char> ti se,<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:68 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mt 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mk 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Lk 9:20</ref></char>
    </note>Sihmon Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, ua veia kami cit khai ni? Nang üng angsäi xünnaka ngthu veki. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>“Atuh ta nang cun Pamhnam üngkhyüh law lü, Ngcingcaihkia Khyang tia jum lü kami ksingki ni,” ti lü, a msang.<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi xaleinghngih cun keia ning jah xüa am nami kyaki aw? Acunsepi, nangmi üng mat cun khawyai ni,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Jesuh naw Sihmon Iskarota capa Judah a pyena kyaki. Judah cun axüisaw xaleinghngih üngkaa kya kyaw lüpi, Jesuh jawiei khaia kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja a nae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Acunkäna Jesuh Kalile hne da citki, Judahe naw hnim hlü u se Judah hne da am cit hlü. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Deut 16:13</ref></char></note>Judahea Sam Pawi cäh law se, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>a nae naw, “Na hnukläke naw na pawhmsah ami hmuh vaia, ahin üngkhyüh Judah hnea cita. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>“U naw amäta ngminga ngthang vai ngja hlü lü, anghmüa i am pawh khawi u. Hin akcanga na jah pawh üng, khawmdek avan naw ksing se,” ami ti. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>(Amäta nae hngawh naw pi am jum u.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka kcün am pha law ham; nangmia kcün cun aläa pha lawki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek naw nangmi am ning jah hneng thei, ami pawhmsah am dawki ka pyena phäh kei na hnengki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi pawia jeng cit ua, kei ta akcün am a pha law hama phäha tuh pawia am cit hlü ham veng,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Acun jah mtheh lü, Jesuh Kalile khawa ve hamki.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sam pawia Jesuh cit hngaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>A nae pawia ami jeng ceh käna, Jesuh pi khyangea käh ksinga anghmüa heng cit hngaki. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Judah ngvaie naw pawia sui hü u lü, “Hawia veki ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Khyang he naw Jesuha mawng ampyua sumkyemkie. Akhäk naw, “Ani ta khyang kdaw ni,” ti se, avang naw, “Am daw, khyang jah mhleiki ni,” ami ti. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Acunsepi, Judah ngvaie ami jah kyüha phäh u naw angdanga am pyen u.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Pawia nghning k’um üng, Jesuh naw Temple k’uma jeng cit lü Pamhnama ngthu jah mtheiki. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Judah ngvaie naw, “Hin, i pi am ngthei khawiki naw ihawkba kca ksingki ni?” ti u lü, münakie.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mtheia ngthu hin kamäta ngaiha ka ning jah mthei am ni. Na tüi lawki Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawkia ngthua kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/><char style="wj">“Au pi, ania ngjak hlü biloki naw ka ngthu pyen hin Pamhnama ngthu ja, kamäta ngaiha ka pyena kyaki aw, ti cun ksing khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/><char style="wj">“Amäta mhnüna ngthu pyenki cun amäta dawnak, hlüngtainak vai suiki ni. Acunsepi ani tüih lawkia hlüngtainak vai suiki cun ngsungpyun lü mkhyenak ani üng am ve. </char> <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/><char style="wj">Mosi naw Thum ning jah peki am niki aw? Mat naw pi Thum am nami läki. Ise nami na hnim khaia nami ngtängki ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Khyang he naw, “Khawyai naw a ning venak ni; u naw ning hnim hlüki ni,” ti u lü, ami msang.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Müncankse mat ka pawh üng avan nami müncankie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ahina phäha ni Mosi naw vun mawih vaia Thum ning jah pe se (Acun cun Mosi üng tüna am kya, nami pupae üngkhyüh tüneikia kpamica üng ami na bilawh khawia kyaki), Sabbath mhnüp üng pi kpamicaa vun nami mawikie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jn 5:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sabbath üng pi kpamicaa vun mawih uki lü, Mosia Thum lümkankia am a kya üng, kei naw Sabbath mhnüp üng khyang ka mdaw bea phäh ka khana ise am nami jeki ni?</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/><char style="wj">“Hmai teng u lü ngthu käh mkhyah ua, ngsungpyun dawkyakia mtai ua,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh hin Mesijah aw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Jerusalem mlüha ka avang naw, “Hin hin Judah ngvaie naw hnim vaia ami büa khyang am niki aw? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>“Teng u, khyangea ksunga ngthu pyen se, i pi am ti na be u. Ani hin Mesijah ti lü ngvaie naw akcanga ksing pängki he aw? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Mesijah a law üng, u naw pi hawia khyüh a law am ksing. Ani ta a ngtüinak law pi khyang naküt naw mi ksing,” ami ti u.<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Acunakyase, Jesuh naw Temple k'uma a jah mthei üng ngpyang lü, <char style="wj">“Kei hawia ka, kei u ti nami na ksing kcangkie aw? Kamäta ngjak hlüa ka lawki am ni. Na tüi lawki cun ngthungtak ni, ani am ksing uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/><char style="wj">“Kei naw ani ka ksingki. Isenitiüng, kei cun ani üngka naw ka lawki, ani naw a na tüih law ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Acunüng Jesuh man vaia ami bü kyaw, akcün am pha hamkia kyase, u naw pi am hnet u. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Khyang avang naw ta jum u lü, “Mesijah a law üng, ania pawhmsaha kthaka daw bawki, müncanksee jah pawhmsah law khai aw” ti u lü amimät ngthäkie.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh man khaia yekape jah tüih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Acukba, khyange cun Jesuha mawng sumkyemkie ti Pharisee naw ami ngjak üng, ktaiyü ngvaie am ngthäh u lü, man khaiea yekape ami jah tüih. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Asängca nami hlawnga ka ve käna, na tüi lawkia veia ka cit be khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw na sui u lü pi, am na hmu uki; ka venaka pi am law thei uki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Judah ngvaie amimät sumkyam u lü, <char style="wj">“Am mi hmu ti vaia, hin hawia cit hlüki ni? Akce kcea ve hükie Krikea veia cit lü, Krike jah mthei hü hlüki aw’</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/><char style="wj">‘Nangmi naw na sui u lü, am nami na hmu khai; ka venaka pi am law thei uki’</char> a ti hin, i a ti hlünak ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xünnaka tui lawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pawia akpäihnak ja akkü säihkia mhnüp üng, Jesuh ngdüiki naw, ngpyang lü, <char style="wj">“Au pi, tui xaiki ka veia law lü aw law se.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hez 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zakh 14:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Au pi, kei na jumki cun Pamhnama cangcim üng a vea mäiha xünnak Tui Lawng cun ani üngkhyüh lawng law khai,”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Jumeikie naw Ngmüimkhya ami yahnak vaia mawng a pyenaka kyaki. Jesuh cun hlüngtainak üng am tho be hamkia kyase, Ngmüimkhya cun jah peta am kya ham.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang he üng ngtainak ve lawki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Khyang avang naw a pyen ngja u lü, “Hin hin Sahma kcanga kya ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Avang naw, “Ani hin Mesijah ni,” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Avange naw pi, “Kalile khaw üngka naw Mesijah hmi law thei khai aw? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref></char></note>Mesijah cun Sangpuxang Davita ksawn üngka, Davita venaka mlüh Bethlehem üng hmi law khai ti lü cangcim üng veki” ami ti. <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Acukba Jesuha phäha khyange ngtaikie. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Avange naw ta man vai ami jum, acunsepi u naw pi am hnet dat u.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judah ngvaie naw am jum u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Yekape ami ceh be üng, ktaiyü ngvaie ja Pharisee naw “Ise am nami lawpüi ni?” ti u se,<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>yekape naw, “Ania mäiha u naw ngthu am pyen khawi” ti lü ami jah msang be.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Pharisee naw, “Nangmi pi a ning jah nghmawngmhlei hnga aw? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>“Ngvaie ja Pharisee üngka ani jumki nami ksing khawiki aw? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>“Mosia Thum am ksingkia khyange ta yüncenak khamei ve u,” ti lü, ami pyen.<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Ahlana mthana Jesuha veia lawkia Pharise üngka khyang mat Nikawdim naw, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Amäta mpyawng ye üng a ngthu am ngja kaa, a pawhmsah am hmu kaa, mi Thum üng khyang am mi cijang khawi,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Amimi naw, “Nang pi Kalile khyanga na kya hngaki aw? Cangcim üng tenga, Kalile khaw üng sahma, u am hmi law khawi,” ti lü na hmu khai.<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kpami am bäühmakia nghnumi ami man</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>[Amimäta im phähphäha cit bekie. Acunüng pi, Jesuh cun Olip Mcunga kaiki. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Ngawilama Templea law be se, khyang naküt a veia lawkie. Acunüng, Jesuh naw ngaw lü jah mtheiki. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Thum mthei he ja Pharisee naw nghnumi mat kpami am bäühmaki xawi lawpüi u lü; avana maa ami ngdüihsak. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Jesuha veia, “Saja aw, hina nghnumi kpami am ani bäühma k’um bäbä üng ami mana kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Deut 22:22-24</ref></char></note>“Mi Thum üng, Mosi naw hina mäih cun lung am vawi ngen vaia ngthu a mkhyah. Nang naw ihawkba na ngaiki ni?” ami ti. <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Acuna ngthu cun Jesuh mhnüteinaka, a mkhyenak ami suinaka ami kthäha kyaki. Acunsepi Jesuh naw ngmüm lü, a kut mdawng am mdek üng kca yuki. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Kthäh laihlaih u se, ngkyäk law be lü, <char style="wj">“Nangmi üng am mkhyekat khawikia khyang naw akcüka lung am vawi se,” </char>a ti. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Acunüng, ngmüm betü lü a kut mdawng am mdek üng yuk betüki. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>A pyen ami ngjak üng, amimäta mkhyenake ksing law u lü, axü säih üngka naw akdik säih cäpa mat cia khyük be päihkie. Acunüng Jesuh amät däk ve se, nghnumi anglung üng a venak kung üng veki. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Jesuh naw a ngmümnak üngkhyüh ngkyäk law be lü, nghnumi amät däk ve se a hmu üng, <char style="wj">“Nghnumi aw, hawia ni ami ve u? Ning mkatei khai u pi am ve se mä?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Nghnumi naw, “Bawipa aw, u naw am na mkat ve,” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei naw pi am ning mkat veng; cit be lü tuh üngkhyüh ta käh mkhyekat ti kawpi,”</char> a ti.]<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh cun khawmdeka akvai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Deut 22:22-24</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh naw ami veia ngthu pyen be lü, <char style="wj">“Kei cun khawmdeka kvaia ka kyaki. Ka hnu läki naküt cun nghmüpa k'um üng käh xünsei ti lü, xünnaka kvai yahei khaie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jn 5:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pharisee naw, “Namäta mawng na pyenki, na pyen am cang ve,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kamäta ngthu ka pyen üngpi ka pyen cangki. Isenitiüng, kei naw ka lawnak ja ka cehnak vai ka ksingeiki. Nangmi naw ka lawnak ja ka cehnak vai am ksing uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw nghngicim thum üng ngthu nami mkhyah khawiki, kei naw u am mtai pet nawng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/><char style="wj">“Kei naw ngthu ka mkhyah üngpi ka ngthumkhyah cang khai. Isetiakyaküng, kei kamät däk am ni. Na tüih lawki Pa kei üng a ngpüia phäh ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/><char style="wj">“Nami Thum üng, ‘Ai pi cangki ti ksing vaia saksi nghngih hlüki,”</char> ti lü, ng’yuki. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/><char style="wj">“Kei kamäta ngthu ka saksiki, Pa na tüih lawki naw pi ka mawng saksiki,”</char> ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Acunkäna amimi naw, “Na Pa hawia ni?” ti lü ami kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi naw kei am na ksing uki, ka Pa pi am ksing uki. Kei nami na ksing üng ka Pa pi nami ksing khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Acuna ngthu cun Temple k'uma khawthem petnaka hnüna a jah mtheia kyaki. Cunsepi u naw pi akcün am küm law hamkia kyase am man u.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ka cehnak vaia am cit khawh uki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei naw akcea ka ning jah ceh ta khai; nangmi naw nami na sui hü khaie. Cunüngpi nami mkhyekatnake üng nami thi khaie. Ka cehnaka am cit thei uki,”</char> ti lü, a jah mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Judah ngvaie naw, <char style="wj">‘“Ka cehnaka am cit thei uki,”</char> a ti hin amät nghnimei hlü bang se,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nangmi ta khawmdek üng nami sängeiki, kei ta khan üngkhyüh ka lawki. Nangmi cun hina khawmdek üngkhyüh nami ngtüi lawkia kya lü, kei ta khawmdek üng am sängei ve ngü.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, ‘Nami mkhyekatnake üng nami thi khai’ ka ti ni. ‘Kei cun Ania Ka Kyaki’ ti am nami jum üng nami mkhyekatnake üng nami thi kcang khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Amimi naw, “Nang u ni?” ti u se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jesuh naw<char style="wj">“Akcüka nami veia ka pyen khawi cen,</char><verse eid="JHN 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>
    <char style="wj">nangmia phäha ka pyen vai ja, ka ning jah mkatnak vai khawhah veki. Na tüih lawki cun ngthungtak üng kümceiki; ani üngkhyüh ka ngjak naküt khawmdek üng ka mtheh khawiki,”</char> ti lü a jah msang be.<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Jesuh naw ami veia a pyena Paa mawng cun am ngjakkya u. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Acunakyase, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa nami taih käna, ‘‘Kei cun Ania Ka Kyaki’ ti nami ksing law khai. Acun käna, kei naw kamäta ngjak hlüa i am pawh lü, Pa naw a na mtheha mäih cia hina ngthu ka pyenki ti nami ksing law khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/><char style="wj">“Na tüih lawki kei üng atänga veki. Kamätca am na hawih. Isetiakyaküng, aläa ania ngjak hlüa ka pawhmsaha phäh kyaki,”</char> ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Acuna ngthu a pyen ngjakia khyang khawhah naw jumkie.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpya üngkhyüh lätnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Jesuh naw jumeiki Judahea veia, <char style="wj">“Ka ngthu pyen nami ngjak üng, ka xüisawea nami kya kcang khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/><char style="wj">“Ngthungtak nami ksing üng, ngthungtak naw ning jah lätsak khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mt 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Lk 3:8</ref></char>
    </note>Amimi naw, “Abrahama mjüa kami kyaki, tuh vei cäpa usüma mpyaa am thawn khawi u nawng, ‘Lätlangnak nami yah khai’ ti hin, i na tinak ni?” ti lü ami kthäh betü.<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: mkhyekatnak pawhki naküt cun mkhyenaka mpyaa kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/><char style="wj">“Mpya cun ima asäng ni a ve khawi; capa ta angläta ima ve khawiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, Capa naw mpya üngkhyüh a ning jah mhlät üng, nami lät kcang khaie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/><char style="wj">“Abrahama mjüa nami kyaki ti ka ksingki. Acunsepi, na hnim khaia nami bü hin, keia mtheimthangnak am nami dodangeia phäha kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/><char style="wj">“Ka Paa na mhnuh naküt ka pyenki. Acunüng pi nangmi naw nami paa ning jah mtheh nami pawhkie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Amimi naw, “Keimia pa ta Abraham” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Abrahama caea nami kya üng Abrahama a awmiha mäiha nami awmih khai sü.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnama veia ngthungtak ka ngjak naküt ning jah mtheh ngü se, nami na hnim hlüki. Abraham ahikba am ve khawi naw.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi hin nami paa vea mäiha nami awmki he ni,”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Amimi naw, “Pamhnam däk ni kami pa, ania jah ca kcang ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pamhnam nami Pa ani üng nami na mhläkphya na khai sü; Pamhnam üngka naw va ka lawki, kamäta ngaiha ka lawkia am ni, ani naw a na tüih law ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/><char style="wj">“Ise ka pyena suilam am nami ngjakyaki he ni? Ka ngthu pyen am nami ngaih hlüa phäh, am nami ngjakkya u ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi cun nami pa Khawyama canaa nami kyaka phäh, nami paa ngjak hlü bi vai ni nami mlung ngaih. Khawyam cun akcüka khyüh khyang k’hnima kyaki. Ngthungtak am vekia kyase, ngthungtak üng am xüngsei. A ngthuei üngpi, hleihlak lü hleihlaknaka pa a thawna phäh, amät am ngkäki va anaküt biloki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/><char style="wj">“Ngthungtak ka pyena phäh, nangmi naw am nami na jumki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/><char style="wj">“Ka mkhyekatnak mdang thei khai u nami veki ni? Ngthungtak ka pyen üng nangmi naw ise am nami na jumkie ni?</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/><char style="wj">“Pamhnam üngkhyüh ngtüiki naw Pamhnama ngthu ngai khawiki, nangmi cun Pamhnam üngkhyüh am nami ngtüikia kyase Pamhnama ngthu am nami ngaiki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Judahe naw, “Nang Samarih khyang, khawyaia venaka kya veki kami ti hin am kami cangki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khawyaia venaka am kya nawng. Ka Pa ka leisawngki, cunüng pi nangmi naw am na leisawng ve uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/><char style="wj">“Kei naw ta kamät ami na leisawngnak vai am sui veng; acun suihjap lü keia phäh cijangki mat veki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: ka ngthu ngaiki naküt isüm käh thi khai,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Judahe naw, “Khawyaia venaka na kyak hman tuh ni kami ksing ve u. Abraham ja sahma he pi thi päng u se, nang naw ‘Na ngthu ngaiki naküt isüm käh thi khai’ ti veki. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>“Kami pu, Abraham kthaka na däm bawki aw? Ani pi thi pängki, sahma he pi thi pängki he . Namät hin ua na ngaieiki ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kamät ka mhlünmtaiei üng, ia käh ka mawng khai. ‘Kami Pamhnam,’ nami tia, ka Pa naw na mhlünmtaiki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw ani am ksing khawi uki. Cunüng pi, kei naw ta ani ka ksingki. ‘Ani am ksing nawng’ ka ti üng nangmia mäiha ka hleihlak hngakia kya khai. Acunakyase, ani ksing lü, a mtheh ka ngjaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/><char style="wj">“Nami pa Abraham naw, ka law vaia khawmhnüp a hmuh vaia phäh jekyaiki. Acunüng, hmu law lü je khütki,”</char> ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Judahe naw, “Na kum mhmakip pi am law ham lü, Abraham na hmuki pängki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: Abraham am a ve ham üng, ka veki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Ami vawihnak vaia lung jah loei u se, Jesuh cun ngthup lü, Temple üngkhyüh akcea citki.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">A mikmüa hmi lawki Jesuh naw a mdaw be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Jesuh lama a ceh k’um üng, a hmi law üngkhyüh a mik müki khyang mat a hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Axüisawe naw, “Saja aw, a mik müa hmiki hin ua mkhyenaka phäha ni? Amäta mkhyenaka phäh aw, a nupaa ani mkhyenaka phäh aw?” ti lü, ami kthäh u.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Amäta mkhyenaka phäh am ni, a nupaa mkhyenaka phäha pi am ni. Ani üng Pamhnama johit khyange naw ami hmuh vaia phäha ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/><char style="wj">“A mhnüp ham üng na tüih lawkia khut mi pawh khai. U naw pi khut am a binak theia mthan pha law hlüki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mt 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Khawmdeka khana ka vea küt üng khawmdeka kvaia ka kyaki,</char>” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Acukba a pyen käna, mdek üng a mci msawh lü, a mci am mdek mthaü lü acun am a mikmüa mik a jut. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>A mikmü üng, <char style="wj">“Cit lü Silawng Tuili üng va hmaieia,”</char> a ti. (Silawng ti cun “Tüih” tinak ni) Acunüng, cit lü va hmaiei se a mik vai law beki.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>A impei locenge ja, ahlana täei se hmu khawikie naw, “Hin hin ngaw lü täei khawiki am niki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Avang naw, “Acun ni” ami ti. Avang naw, “Acun ta am ni” a tängpüi ni” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Amät naw, “Kei acun ni” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Amimi naw, “Na mik ihawkba vai beki?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Ani naw, “Jesuh ami ti naw mdek mthaü lü, ka mik üng jut lü, ‘Silawng Tuilia va cit lü va hmaieia’ ti se, cit lü hmaiei ngü se ka mik vai law beki,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>“Ani hawia veki ni?” ti lü a mi kthäh üng,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">ani naw “Am ksing veng” a ti be.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pharisee naw a mika daw bea mawng ami kthäh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>A mik mü khawikia khyang cun Phariseea veia ami cehpüi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Jesuh naw mdek mthaü lü a mik a vaisak bea mhnüp cun Sabbath mhnüpa kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Pharisee naw, a mik a vai law bea mawng kthäh u se, ani naw, “Lawk am ka mik na nawi se, hmaei lü, ka hmu law be theiki ni,” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Pharise avang naw, “Acuna khyang naw Sabbath am a jeiha phäha, Pamhnama üngkhyüh lawki ta am ni khü vai,” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Avang naw, “Khyangka naw ihawkba hina mäih müncanksee jah pawh khawh khai aw?” ami ti. Phariseea ksunga ngtainak ve lawki.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Acun käna, amikmü üng, “Na mik a vaisak bea phäha, nang naw ihawkba ani na ngaiki ni?” ti u lü, ami kthäh betü üng,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">“Ani cun Sahma ni” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Judah ngvaie naw, a mik vai law bekia nu ja pa, am ami jah khü ham veia, amikmü khawiki vai law beki ni tia mawng am kcang na u. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>A nu ja a paa üng, “Hin hin nami ca, amikmüa hmi lawki nami ti khawi am niki aw? Ihawkba atuh hmu law be theiki ni?” ti u lü, ami jah kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>A nu ja pa naw, “Hin kami ca ti kami ksingki, amikmüa hmi lawki ti pi kami ksing. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Cunsepi, ihawkba atuh hmu law beki ti am kani ksingki, hmuhsak beki pi am ksing ve ning. Amät kthäh ua; khyang teh lawki; amäta mawng cun amät naw pyen se,” ti ni lü, ani jah msang. <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>A nu ja pa naw Judah ngvaie ami jah kyüha phäha acukba ani pyena kyaki. Am acun ham üng pi, “Ani cun Mesijah ni” tiki naküt cun sinakok üngkhyüh ksät vaia ami mkhyäp thüpthüpa kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Acunakyase, a nu ja pa naw, “Khyang teh lawki, amät kthäh ua” ani tia kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Anghngihnaka amikmüa hmi lawki cun khü betü u lü, “Pamhnama veia akcang ka pyen khai tia sitih taa, nang ning mdaw beki cun khyangka ti kami ksingki ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Ani naw, “Khyangka a ni ja am a ni am ksing nawng. Mat ka ksing cun ahlana ka mik mü khawiki, tuh ka hmu law beki,” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Amimi naw, “Na khana i ja a pawh? Na mik ihawkba ja a vaisak be?” ti lü, ami kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Ani naw, “Cükta üng ka ning jah mtheh päng, am nami na ngai hlüki. Ise nami ngja hlü betükie ni? Nangmi pi axüisaw hea nami thawn hngaa nami yüki aw?” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Amimi naw ksekha na u lü, “Nang hin ania xüisawa na kyaki ni, keimi ta Mosia axüisaw he ni. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>“Pamhnam naw Mosi ngthuhei püiki ti kami ksingki, cunüngpi Jesuh hawia ka naw lawki ti am ksing u nawng,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>“Ani naw ka mik vaisak be kyaw sepi, ani hawia khyüh lawki ti am nami ksing hin müncankse ni. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>“Pamhnam naw khyangkaa ngthu am ngai khawiki ti mi ksingki. Acunsepi, au naw pi Pamhnam mhläkphya na lü a ngjakhlü a pawh üng Pamhnam naw ngaih pet khawiki. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>“Khawmdek a ngtüi üngkhyüh, a mikmüa hmi lawki vaisak be ve u, tia u naw am mi ngja khawi. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>“Hin hin Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawki am a ni ta, i am pawh khawh,” ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Amimi naw, “Na hmi law üng, mkhyenake am hmi law lü, na jah mthei lawki aw?” ti u lü, msangkie naw, Sinakok üngka naw ami ksät u.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngmüimkhya mik mükie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Ksätkie ti Jesuh naw ksing lü hmuki naw, <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa na jumki aw?”</char> ti lü a kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ani naw, “Bawipa aw, ka jum law vaia, ani u ni na mtheha?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ani na hmu päng ni, atuh ning ngthuheipüiki hin ani ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ani naw, “Bawipa aw, jum veng,” ti lü, Jesuh hjawkhahki.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ngthumkhyah khaia hina khawmdek khana ka lawki, amikmüea mik vai be lü, a mik kvaiea mik a münak vaia ka lawki ni,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Ahlawnga vekia Pharisee naw, acun ngja u lü, “Keimi pi kami mik mü hngaki aw?” ti lü, ami kthäh u.<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami mik a mü üng mkhyenak am ta uki. Acunsepi, atuh ‘Kami mik vaiki’ nami tia phäh nami mkhyekatki”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Toksäm am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Jesuh naw<char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: to ngvawng mkawt üng käh lut lü, akce üngka naw kai lü lutki cun mpyukeiea ja tome manei hlükiea kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/><char style="wj">“Mkawt üng lutkia khyang cun toksäma kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/><char style="wj">“Mkawt mtät naw ani cun mkawt nghmawn pet se, toe naw a kthai ksing khawikie; amäta toe ami ngming phähphäh am jah khü lü kpunga jah ceh püi khawiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/><char style="wj">“Kpunga a jah khü üng, ami hmaia cit lü lam jah msüm se ani cun läk khawikie. Isetiakyaküng, a kthai cun a toe naw ksingki he.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, khyang kce cun a kthai am ami ksinga kyase, am läk u, dawngin ta khaie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Ahina msuimcäpnak Jesuh naw jah mtheh se, i a ti hlü hman am ksing u.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh toksäm kdaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Acunüng, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: kei cun toe phäh mkawta ka kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/><char style="wj">Keia hmaia law maki naküt cun mpyukei ja tome manei hlükiea kyaki he, to naw pi a kthai am jah ngja.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/><char style="wj">“Kei mkawta ka kyaki. Kei üngkhyüh lutki naküt naw küikyanak yah khai; a k’uma lut lü, akpunga lut law lü, a ei vai hmu khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/><char style="wj">“Mpyukei cun mpyu khai, hnim khai ja kpye khaia va law khawiki. Kei cun xünnak ami yahnak vai däka am kya lü kümkawikia xünnak ami yah vaia phäha ka lawki ni.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kei toksäm kdawa ka kyaki; toksäm kdaw naw toea phäha a sak tawn khawhki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/><char style="wj">“Toksäm am niki, ami ngvaha toksäm naw mhnge law se a hmuh üng toe jah hawih lü jah dawng ta se, mhnge naw toe jah hutei lü jah kpyang khawiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/><char style="wj">“Ami ngvaha toksäm cun ngvaha kyase, toe am jah cäi na lü jah dawng taki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mt 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Lk 10:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Kei cun dawkia toksäm ni. Pa naw na ksing se kei naw pi Pa ka ksinga mäiha, ka toe ka jah ksingki. Ka toe naw pi na ksingki he. “Ami phäha ta ka thih khawhki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/><char style="wj">“Ahina to ngvawnga k'uma am veki toe pi ka jah ta hamki. Acun he pi ka jah lawpüi khai. Acun he naw pi ka kthai ngai u se, to pä mat, toksäm mat däka kya law khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kei naw ka sak tawn lü, xünnak ka yah be khaia kyase, Pa naw na mhläkphyanaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/><char style="wj">“U naw ka sak am lak thei. Kamäta hlüeia ka sak ka pet ni. Ka sak cun pe lü, ka loei be khawhnaka khyaibahnak ka taki. Ahina ngthupet hin ka Paa veia ka yaha kyaki,” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Acuna ngthua phäha Judahea ksunga ngtainak ve lawki. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Aknung bawk naw, “Ani üng khawyai umki ni, yawki ni; ise a ngthu nami ngaiki ni?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Avang naw, “Khawyaia venak naw ahin he am jah pyen thei. Khawyai naw ihawkba amikmüe jah vaisak be khawh khai ni? ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh am jumkia Judah khyange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Khawksik khya üng Jerusalem mlüh Temple Kainaka Pawi veki. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Jesuh cun Temple k'um, Solamon Luhnak üng ve hlü se, <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Judahe naw a peia ngbäm law u lü, “Am ngsingngkyaikia i vei na ve ham khai ni? Mesijah na kyak üng angsinga jah mtheha,” ti lü kthähkie.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mtheh päng ni, am nami jumki; ka Paa ngming am khut ka pawhe cun ka saksie ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, ka toea am nami nia phäh, am na jum uki.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/><char style="wj">“Ka toe naw ka kthai ksing khawikie, kei naw jah ksing ngü se, na läk law khawikie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/><char style="wj">Amimi üng angsäia xünnak ka jah pet, i tia pi am thi u. Amimi cun u naw pi am na jah hutei thei u. </char> <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/><char style="wj">“Amimi na jah pekia ka Pa cun anaküta kthaka hlüngtai bawki; u naw pi Paa kut üngka am loei thei.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/><char style="wj">“Kei ja ka Pa cun mata kani kyaki,”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Judahe naw ami khawngnak vaia lung loei betükie. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Cunsepi Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Nami hmuha Pa naw a na pet khut akdaw khawhah ka pawhki ni, ia phäha lung am nami na khawng hlüki ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Judahe naw, “Khut akdaw na pawha phäha lung am kami ning khawng hlüki am ni. Pa na pyenkse ja, nang nghngicim khyanga kya kphei lü Mhnama na ngsuieia phäh ni,” ti lü, ami msang.<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:6">Sal 82:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Namimäta Thum üng, ‘Nangmi cun mhnamea nami kyaki ka ti’ ti lü am ng’yuk mä?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/><char style="wj">“Cangcima pyen naküt cun anghläia cangki ti mi ksingki. Pamhnam naw mhnamea a jah suia khyange üng a ngthu jah peki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/><char style="wj">“Pa naw mcawn lü khawmdek khana a na tüih law kei naw, ‘Kei Mhnama Capa ka tia phäha, ‘Mhnam na pyenkseki’ nami na tinaki aw?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/><char style="wj">“Ka Paa ngjak hlü am ka pawh üng, käh na jum kawm uki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, ka Pa a khut ka pawh üng ta, kei am nami na jum üng pi, Pa kei üng a ve ja Pa üng kei ka vea mawng ahun nami ksing hin anglät cäng khaia, ka pawhmsahea hleng ta nami jum vai sü”</char> ti lü, a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Jesuh man khaiea ami bü be kyaw, acunsepi, ami kut üngka naw lätei betüki.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jn 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jordan Mliktuia caye, Johan naw akcüka Baptican a jah petnak da cit lü acuia veki. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Khyang khawkän a veia law u lü, “Johan naw müncankse i am pawh; acunsepi Johan naw hina mawng a pyen naküt cang ve” tikie. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Acunüng, acuia khyang khawkän naw Jesuh jumkie.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lazaruha thiha mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Lk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref></char>
    </note>Lazaruh ngmingnaki am khyaihki cun Bethanih mlüha veki. Acuna Bethanih mlüh cun Marih ja a na Matah ami venaka kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref></char></note>Hina Marih cun (A na Lazaruh am khyaihki) ksi ng’ui am Jesuh jut lü a khaw a lusam am xuh petki. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Lazaruha ci xawi naw, “Bawipa aw, na mhlänak na püi am khyaih ve” ti lü Jesuh ani cük.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Jesuh naw acun ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Acuna natnak cun thihnak vaia natnak am ni; Pamhnama hlüngtainak a ngdangnak vaia kyaki ni, ahina phäha Pamhnama Capa a ngming hlüngtai khai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Jesuh naw Matah, a na Marih ja Lazaruh cun aktäa jah mhläkphyanaki. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Acunakyase, Lazaruh am khyaihki ti a ngjak käna pi am cit lü, a venaka mhnüp nghngih ve hamki. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Acun käna, axüisaw hea üng, <char style="wj">“Judah khawa mi cit be vai u” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Axüisawe naw, “Rabbi, ahlana Judahe naw lung am ning khawng hlükie; acuia na cit hlü betüki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Khaw mhnüp mat üng naji xaleinghngih lawki, am niki aw. Mhnüpa cit hükia khyang ta khawmdeka kvai hmuh lü am ngsukngvän khawi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/><char style="wj">Acunsepi, mthana a ceh hü üng akvai am vekia kyase, ngsukngvänei khawiki”</char> ti lü, a jah msang. <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Acun a pyen päng ja, <char style="wj">“Mi püi u Lazaruh ipki; ipki mtho be khaia ka cit khai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Axüisawe naw, “Bawipa aw, a ih üng ta daw law be khai ni” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Jesuh naw a thiha mawng a pyen kyaw, amimi naw ipei sawxatkia ami ngaih u. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Acunakyase, Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Lazaruh thiki” ti lü angsinga a jah mtheh.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/><char style="wj">“Acuia am ka ve hin nami jumnak vaia, nami phäh ka jeki; acunsepi a veia mi cit vai u”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Thomah (Angphia ami sui) naw a püi he üng, “A thihnak üng thi hnga khaia, Saja am atänga mi cit vai u” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh cun thawhnak be ja xünnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Jesuh a pha law üng, Lazaruh ami k’uhnak mhnüp kphyü law päng se a hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bethanih mlüh cun Jerusalem mlüh üngkhyüh mäng nghngih bang thuki. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Ani be thi se, Judahe cun naw jah mbawikyahpüi khaiea Matah ja Mariha veia lawkie.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Matah naw Jesuh pha law hlüki ti a ngjak üng do khaia citki. Acunüng Marih cun ima a na veki. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Matah naw Jesuh üng, “Bawipa aw, ahia na vea ta ka be am thi khai sü. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>“Tuh pi Pamhnama veia na kthäh naküt Pamhnam naw ning pe khai ti ka ksingki” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na be tho law be khai” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Matah naw, “Akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng tho law be khai ti ka ksingki” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei hin thawhnak be ja xünnaka ka kyaki ni. Kei na jumeiki naküt cun xüng khai, a thih üngpi angsäia xüng khai;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/><char style="wj">xüng lü, kei na jumki naküt cun itüha pi am thi ti u. Ka pyen na jumki aw?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Matah naw “Bawipa aw, jum veng. Nang cun khawmdeka law khaia Mesijah, Mhnama Capaa na kyaki ti jum veng” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh kyapki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Acukba a pyen päng ja Matah cit lü a ci Marih anghmüa khü lü, “Bawipa pha law lü ning khü ve” a ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Marih naw a ngjak ja tho law ngxit lü Jesuh hmuh khaia citki. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Jesuh cun ngnam k'uma am lut law ham lü, Matah naw a va hmuhnak, a venaka ve hamki. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Im k'uma mbawikyahpüi u lü awmki hea Judahe naw Marih angxita tho law lü va kco se ami hmuh üng, lungdüa kyap khaia cit hlükia ngai lü läki he.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Marih cun Jesuha venaka a va pha üng, a hmuh ja a khaw kunga kawp lü, “Bawipa aw, hia na vea ta ka be am thi khai sü” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Mariha kyah ja läk lawkiea kyah a hmuh üng Jesuha mlung aktäa na lü pukseki. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“A yawk hawia nami tak ni?”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Amimi naw, “Bawipa aw law lü teng lawa” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Jesuh naw hmu lü kyapki. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Judahe naw, “Teng u, Lazaruh ihlawka a mhläkphyanak ni” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Acunsepi avang naw, “Hin, amikmü pi vaisak beki am niki aw. Lazaruh pi käh thi khaia am pawh theiki aw?” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lazaruh xüng law beki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Jesuh aktäa pukse lü, ng’ui hnün da lawki. Acuna ng’utnak cun mdek khüia kya lü lung am ami khaih. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Lung loa”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Thikia a ci Matah naw, “Bawipa aw, a thihnak mhnüp kphyü law pängki, tuh ta thu päng khai ni” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na jum üng Pamhnama hlüngtainak na hmu khai, ti lü am ka ning mtheh pängki aw?”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Lung lo u se, Jesuh naw khana jeng mang lü, <char style="wj">“Ka Pa aw, ka ngthu na ngaiha phäh, ning je na veng,</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/><char style="wj">“Aläa ka ngthu na ngai khawiki ti ksing veng; acunsepi hin üng veki khyange naw kei hin nang naw na na tüih law ti ami jumnak thei vai ka pyen ni” </char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Acukba a pyen päng ja, <char style="wj">“Lazaruh, lut lawa”</char> ti lü, angsanga ngpyangki. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Akthi cun a kut khaw hlawpnaka jih ja a hmai hlawpnaka jih mahmaha lut law se Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Sut u lü, cehsak ua”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh hnim vaia cengkie </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Marih vepüikiea Judah avang naw Jesuha bilawh hmu u lü Jesuh jumkie. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Acunsepi avang ta Phariseea veia cit u lü, Jesuh naw a pawhmsahe ami jah va mtheh. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Pharisee naw Kawngci ngvaie jah ngkhämpüi u lü, “Ihawkba mi pawh khai? Hina khyang naw müncanksee khawhah pawh ve. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Ahikba mi hawihin üng ta, khyang naküt naw ani jum law u se, acunüng, Romah ngvaie naw mi Temple ja mi khyangmjü jah kpyükpye law khaie ni” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Ami hlawnga ka khyang mat Kaiphah, acuna kum üng Ktaiyü Ngvaisäih naw, “Ise nami yawkie ni, <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>mi khyangmjü naküt a pyüpye kthaka khyang mat a thih hin daw bawki ti am nami ksingki he aw” a ti. <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Acuna ngthu cun amät naw mhnün lü a pyen sawxat am ni. Acuna kum üng Ktaiyü Ngvai säiha kyase, Jesuh cun Judah khyang mjüea phäh a thih vaia mawng malam a pyena kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Acuna khyange däka phäh am ni lü, khawmdeka khana ngpyeng hükia Pamhnama khyange cun pumsa mata a jah mkhämnak be vai phäha pi kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Acuna mhnüp üngkhyüh Judah ngvaie naw Jesuh hnim khaia cengkie. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Acunakyase, Jesuh cun Judahea khaw ksunga angdanga käh citcawn hü ti lü, acun üngka naw mkyangkhawa, mlüh mat Epharam ami tia citeiki. Acuia axüisaw he am awmki he.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Judahea Lätnak Pawi cäh law se, khyang khawkän ami khaw üngka naw Jerusalem mlüha amimät naw khawning ngcingcaihnak pawi am a pha law ham üng bi khaiea jeng citkie. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Jesuh sui hü u lü, Temple k’uma ngkhäm u lü, “Pawi pawhnaka am law khai aw, ihawkba nami ngaiki ni?” ti lü ami püi kthäkie. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Pharisee naw, Jesuh ami mannak thei vaia, au pi, a venak ksingki naw a pyen vaia ami jah mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Bethanih mlüha Jesuh ksi ng’ui am buih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mt 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Lätnak Pawi a phanak vai a mhnüp khyuk üng, thi se a mthawh be Lazaruha venak, Bethanih mlüha Jesuh pha lawki. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Acuia Jesuha mü ei vai buh pyangnaka Matah naw jah kpüiki. Acuia Lazaruh pi Jesuh am atänga ngaw hngaki. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Lk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note>Marih naw aktäa a phu küikia natuh ksi ng’ui liter uma cäpcäp lawpüi lü, Jesuha khaw jah buiki naw a lusam am a xuh pet. Acuna ksi ng’ui cun im k’um naküt üng ng'uiki. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Acunsepi, axüisaw he üngka mat, Judah Iskarot, Jesuh phyahei khai naw, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Hina ksi ng’ui hin, ise ngui phya kthuma jawi lü, msih mpyaki he üng am a jah pet ni?” a ti. <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Msih mpyaki he a jah mpyeneia phäh acukba a pyen am ni, khyang mpyukeia a kyaa thea, nguiip cüm lü, a k’uma ngui a lawhei khawia phäha kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hawih ua, ka ng’utnak mhnüpa phäh pawh se.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Deut 15:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Msih mpyaki he cun aläa nami hlawnga awmki he ni. Kei cun aläa nami hlawnga ka ve khaia am kya” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lazaruh ami cengnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Jesuh Bethaniha veki ti Judahe naw ksing u lü, ami lawsih. Jesuh däk lawsihkie am ni, thihnak üngka naw a mthawh be Lazaruh pi ami hmuh hlüa phäha kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie naw Lazaruh pi ami hnim vaia cengkie; <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Lazaruha phäha Judah khyang khawhah naw jah hawih u lü, Jesuh ami juma phäha kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hlüngtainak am Jerusalem a luhnak </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Angawi üng, Lätnak Pawia lawkia khyangpänu naw Jesuh Jerusalema law hlüki ti ami ksing üng, <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Sal 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref> </char></note>nghleng hnahe jah kcüngei lü do khaia cit u lü, “Hosana, Bawipa ngming üng lawki Pamhnam naw dawkyanak pe se!” Pamhnam naw Isarelea sangpuxang dawkyanak pe se” ti lü ngpyangkie.<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Jesuh naw sanghngaksaü hmu lü, acuna khana ngcumki. Cangcim üng ang’yuka mäiha,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakh 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Zion mlüh aw, käh kyüheia;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Tenga sanghngaksaüca üng cum lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">na sangpuxang law ve.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Asüa ta axüisaw he naw am ksing u. Acunsepi Jesuh mhlünmtai a ni üng, Jesuha mawng cangcim naw a pyen ja ania phäh ahikba ami bilawhe ti cun süm law bekie.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Lazaruh, ng’utnak üngka naw a khü be, thihnak üngka a mthawh be üng, a peia awmki hea khyange naw pi a mawngma pyenkie. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Acunakyase, khyange naw pi a na do u lü ümhlamkie. Acukba müncanksee jah pawhki ni ti ngjakie. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Pharisee amimät naw, “Teng u, i am mi pawh khawhki, khawmdek avan naw a hnu läk päng ve” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krik khyange naw Jesuh suikie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Pawia Pamhnam hjawkhah khaia Jerusalem mlüha jeng citkie üng Krike avang pi cit hngakie. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Acun he cun Philipa (Kalile hne Bethsaida mlüha ka kyaki) veia law u lü, “Saja aw, Jesuh kami hmu hlüki” ti lü ami nghuinak.<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Philip naw Andru mtheh law se ani nghngih naw Jesuh üng ani va mtheh. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Jesuh naw jah msang lü, <char style="wj">“Khyanga Capa a hlüngtainak vai akcün pha law ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: cangmci mdek üng am kya lü am a thih üng mäei khawiki. A thih üng va khawhaha ngtheipai law be khawiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“A xünsak mcehnaki naküt naw a xünsak mkhyüh khai. Hina khawmdek khana a xünsak hnengki naw angsäia xünnak yah khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/><char style="wj">“Ka khut pawh hlüki naküt naw na läk law se; ka khut pawhki cun ka venaka ve hnga khai. Ka khut pawhkia khyang cun Pa naw mhlünmtai khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw a thih vai a pyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Atuh hin ka mlung khuikha ve. I ka pyen khai ni? ‘Ka Pa aw, hina kcün hin ka khana käh kpha lawa, ka ti khai aw? Iakyasepi, ahina khuikhatnak khamei khaia ni, ka law. </char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/><char style="wj">“Ka Pa aw, na ngming hlüngtai se”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Acunüng, “Ka mhlünmtai pängki, ka mhlünmtai betü khai” tia kthai khankhaw üngka naw a ngjak.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>A peia ngdüikia khyange naw ngja u lü, “Khaw nghmümki ni,” ti u se, avang naw, “Khankhawngsä naw ngthuhei püiki ni,” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acuna kthai cun ka phäha ngthang lawkia am ni, nangmia phäh ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/><char style="wj">“Tukbäih hina khawmdek ngthumkhyahnaka kcüna kyaki. Tukbäih hina khawmdek ukia sangpuxang cun ksäta kya khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/><char style="wj">“Kei, mdek üngka naw khana a na taih law üng, khyang naküt ka veia ka jah kaih khai” </char>a ti. <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Acuna ngthu cun a thih vai ksingnak vaia a pyena kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sal 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Hesa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hez 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char>
    </note>Khyang he naw, <char style="wj">“Mesijah cun angdäia ve khai ti mi Thum üng kami hmuki. Nang naw, ‘Khyanga Capa mdek üngka naw khana taiha kya khai’ na ti hin, i ni? Acuna Khyanga Capa cun u ni?”</char> ti u lü, ami msang.<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Akvai asäng nami hlawnga ve ham ve. Akvai a ve k’um üng cit hü ua, am ani üng ta nghmüp naw ning jah kpha law khai ni. Nghmüp üng cit hüki naw a cehnak am ksingei khawi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/><char style="wj">“Akvai a ve ham üng akvai jumei ua, akvaia canaa nami kya khai”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Khyang he naw Jesuh am jum hlü u</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Acun a pyen päng ja Jesuh cit lü, am ami hmuhnak vaia ngthupeiki.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Ami maa müncanksee khawkän pawh sepi Jesuh am jum u; <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Hesa 53:1</ref></char></note>Sahma Hesajah naw a na pyen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Bawipa aw, kami pyena ngthu u naw jumki ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Bawipa naw ua veia a johit mdanki ni?” tia ngthua kümnak vaia kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Acuna thea am jum u se, sahma Hesajah naw pyen lü,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Hesa 6:10</ref> </char>
    </note>“Pamhnam naw ami mik a jah müsak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ami mlung jah nghlangsak se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">acunüng ami mik naw am hmuh thei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ami lu pi cing se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ka jah mdaw be vaia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ka veia am nghlat law be thei u, ti lü Pamhnam naw pyenki” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Hesajah naw Jesuha hlüngtainak hmu lü ania mawng cun a pyena kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Acunsepi, Judah ngvaie üngka khawkän naw Jesuh jumkie. Pharisee naw sinakoka k’um üngkhyüh ami jah ksät vai kyüh u lü am phyeh u. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Mhnama jah mhlünmtaia kthaka khyanga jah mhlünmtai ami jawngnaka phäh ni.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesuha ngthu am ngthumkhyah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei na jumki naküt cun naw, kei däk na jumki am ni, na tüi lawki pi jumki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/><char style="wj">“Kei na hmuki cun naw, na tüi lawki pi hmuki ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek vaisak khaia ka lawki ni, kei na jumki naküt cun nghmüp üng am ve ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/><char style="wj">“Ka ngthu pyen ngja lü am jum u sepi, kei naw ngthu am jah mkhya pet nawng. Khawmdek ngthumkhyah khaia ka lawki am ni, khawmdek küikyan khaia va ka lawki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/><char style="wj">“Kei na ma lü ka ngthu pyene am ngaiki naw ngthumkhyah pet khai mat taeiki. Ka ngthu pyen, acuna ngthu naw akpäihnaka mhnüp üng ngthumkhyah pet khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/><char style="wj">“Kamät naw khyaihnak am ka pyen am ni; Pa na tüih lawki naw ka pyen vai ja ka sang vai ngthu a na pet ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/><char style="wj">“Ania a na peta ngthu cun anglät xünnaka kyaki ti ka ksingki. Acunakyase, ngthu ka pyen naküt cun Pa naw a na mtheh naküta kyaki” </char> ngpyang lü a pyen.<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw axüisaw hea khaw jah mthih petki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Lätnak Pawi a pha vai mhnüp mat a hlü ham üng, Jesuh naw hina khawmdek ceh ta lü Paa veia a cehnak vai kcün pha lawki ti ksingki. Hina khawmdeka veki a khyange cen aläa jah mhläkphyanak lü adüt vei cäpa jah kphyanaki.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Jesuh ja axüisaw he naw mü buh eikie. Sihmona capa, Judaha mlung k’uma, Jesuh phyehei khaia khawyai naw a mhlawmcawk pänga kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Pa naw ahmäi a mhjum ja Mhnam üngkhyüh law lü Pamhnama veia cit be khai ti cun Jesuh naw ksingki. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Acunakyase, buh capawi üngka naw tho law lü a jih ngvaih sut lü ngxuheinak jih a vawh. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Kbe ksung üng tui kyäi lü axüisaw hea khaw jah mthih pet lü a jih vawh am a jah xuh pet. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Sihmon Pita veia a pha law üng, “Bawipa aw, ka khaw na na mthih hlü petki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tukbäih i ka pawhmsah ti am ksing hamki; acunsepi, tuha ta na ksing law khai ni”</char> ti lü a msang.<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Pita naw, “Ka khaw käh na mthi sümsüm khai” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na khaw am ka ning mthih pet üng ta keia hnukläka am kya tiki”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Sihmon Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, acun ani üng ta ka khaw däk am ni lü ka kut ja ka lu pi na mthih peta” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tui nghlawk pängki naküt ngcimki ni, i a mthih vai am hlü, a khaw däk ni a hlü. Nangmi avan ngcimcaih päng ve uki, acunsepi am ngcimcaih hamki mat ve ve”</char> a ti. (<verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>U naw jawiei khai a ksing pänga phäha, “Nami van nami ngcimki, lüpi am ngcimki mat nami ksunga veki” a ti.)<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Lk 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ami khaw jah mthih pet lü, a jih ngvaih be lü, ngaw beki naw, <char style="wj">“Nami khana ka pawh hin asuilam nami ksingki aw?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw Saja aw, Bawipa aw nami na ti na khawiki. Nami cangki, ka kya kungki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/><char style="wj">“Kei nami na Bawipa ja Saja hngawh naw nami khaw ka ning jah mthih pet üng, nangmi pi mat naw mata khaw nami mthih pet vai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/><char style="wj">“Nami khana ka pawha mäiha nangmi naw pi nami pawh hnga vaia ka ning jah mhnuhki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mt 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Lk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Jn 15:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mtheh ta: mpya cen a mahpa kthaka am däm bawk khawi; ngsäe cun pi jah tüihkia kthaka däm bawkia am kya.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/><char style="wj">“Ahina ngthungtak nami ksingki, nami ksinga mäiha nami xünpüi üng ta ihlawka nami jo sen khai ni.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sal 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Nami vana mawng ka pyen am ni. Ka xüe ka jah ksingki. Acunsepi, ‘Kani ei yümki naw am na ngja hlü ve’ ti lü, cangcima kümkawi lawnak vaia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/><char style="wj">“Ahin hin am a pha law ham üng, atuh ka ning jah mtheh ni. Acun a pha law üng ‘Kei Ania Ka Kyaki’ ti nami jumnak thei vaia ka ning jah mtheh ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: au pi ka tüi law dokhameiki cun kei na dokhameiki ni; au pi ka tüi law dokhamki naw, kei pi na dokhameikia kyaki. Kei na dokhameiki naw pi na tüi lawki dokhamkia kyaki” </char> ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh naw ami man vai pyenki </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mt 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Lk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Jesuh naw acukba a pyen law päng üng a mlung khuikha lü, <char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: nangmi üngka mat naw na phyehei khai”</char> ti lü a jah mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>U a pyennak hman am ksing u lü axüisaw he naw ami püi ci teng lü awmki he. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Axüisawe üngka mat, Jesuha kphyanak cun Jesuha peia ngawki. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Sihmon Pita naw, “U a pyenak ni, na mtheha” ti lü, a kut am khiktawt hü lü a kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Acuna axüisaw naw Jesuh peia va ngnawn lü, “Bawipa aw, u ni?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hina muk mte mcawi lü ka peta khyanga kya khai” </char>ti lü a msang. Muk mte mcawi lü, Sihmona capa Judah üng a pet. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Muk mte a doei ja khawyam a k’uma lutki. Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Na pawh vai akjanga pawha”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Ei kbe kunga ngawkie naw, i a pyennak ti, u naw pi am ksing u. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Avang naw Judah Iskarot naw nguiip a cüma phäh, Jesuh naw, ‘‘Hina pawi üng mi summang vai va khyeia a tinak ni, am ani üng khuikha si mpyaki he üng ik’eih jah pea” tikia, ami ngai.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Judah naw muk mte lo lü cit ktäihki. Acun cun mthana kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngthumkhän kthai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Acukba a ceh käna Jesuh naw pyen lü, <char style="wj">“Atuh hin Khyanga Capa mhlünmtaia kya ve. Ani üngkhyüh Pamhnam pi mhlünmtaia kya ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/><char style="wj">“Ani üngkhyüh Pamhnama hlüngtainak mdan lü, Pamhnam naw Khyanga Capa pi amät üng mhlünmtai khai. Sängsäng se Pamhnam naw ani mhlünmtai khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ka canae aw, nami hlawnga ka ve vai hin am hjo ti. Nami na sui hü khaie. Acunüng, Judah ngvaie üng, ‘Ka cehnak vaia am law thei uki’ ti lü ka pyena mäiha atuh pi acukba bäa ka ning jah mthehki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Jn 5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ngthumkhän kthai ka ning jah peki: mat ja mat mhläkphya na ua. Ka ning jah mhläkphyanaka mäiha mat ja mat mhläkphya na u.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/><char style="wj">“Mat ja mat nami mhläkphyanak üng ta, khyang naküt naw ka hnukläke tia ning jah ksing khaie”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw a ma vai Jesuh naw a pyen </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-33">Mt 26:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-35">Lk 22:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Sihmon Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, hawia na cit khai?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka cehnak hlüa nang tuh am law theiki; tuha ta na law thei khai”</char> ti lü, a msang.<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Pita naw, “Bawipa aw, ise atuh na hlawnga am ka law theiki ni? Na phäha ta thih vai pi am kyüh nawng” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Keia phäha na thih vai akcanga am na kyühki aw? Akcanga ka ning mthehki: nang naw ainghlüi am khawng ham se, ani am ksing ngü ti lü kthum vei na ngcim khai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh cun Paa veia phanak lam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Käh cäicing pukse ua; Pamhnam jumei ua, kei pi na jumei ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/><char style="wj">“Ka Paa ima hnün khawhah veki, nangmia phäh hnün pyang khaia ka cit khai. Hnün am a ve üng, am a vea mawng cun ka ning jah mtheh khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/><char style="wj">“Cit lü nami phäha hnün ka pyang käna, ka nghlat law be khai. Ka venaka nami ve hnga khaia, ka ning jah la law khai,</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/><char style="wj">“Ka cehnak vaia hnün nami ksingki”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Thomah naw, “Bawipa aw, na cehnak vai am ksing ve ung, ihawkba lam kami ksing khai ni” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei cun lama ka kyaki. Ngthungtaka pi ka kyaki. Xünnaka pi ka kyaki. Keia thea Pa veia cehnak vaia lam akce am ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/><char style="wj">“Kei nami na ksing pängki, ka Pa pi nami ksing khaie; tukbäih üngkhyüh cutei lü ani ksing päng lü hmu päng ve uki”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Philip naw, “Bawipa aw, Pa jah mhnuha, acun ni kami hlüei” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Philip, hi vei nami hlawnga ve ngü se, am na na ksingki aw? Au pi kei na hmuki cun Pa hmuki ni. ‘Pa jah mhnuha’ ise na ti ni?</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/><char style="wj">“Kei Pa üng ka ve ja Pa kei üng veki ti, am na jumki aw, Philip? Nami veia ka pyene hin kamäta mhnün ka pyena am ni. Kei üng vekia Pa naw a jah pawha kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/><char style="wj">“Pa üng kei ka ve ja kei üng Pa veki ti jum ua. Am ani üng ka jah pawhmsahea phäh hleng ta na jum ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: au pi na jumki naw ka jah pawhmsahe jah pawh khai; ahina kthaka däm bawkie pi jah pawhmsah law khai. Isetiakyaküng Paa veia ka cit khaia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/><char style="wj">“Ka ngming üng ahmäi nami täsam naküt ka ning jah pawh pet khai. Acun cun Pa, Capaa phäh a hlüngtainak vaia phäha kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw ka ngming üng ahmäi nami täsam üng, nami täsama mäiha ka ning jah pawh pet khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyütam Ngmüimkhya ngcim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nangmi naw nami na kphyanak üng, ka ngthumkhäne nami jah läk khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/><char style="wj">“Pa kthäh ngü se, ani naw ning jah Kpüikpak khai akce ning jah pe khai. Acun naw aläa ning jah vepüi khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/><char style="wj">“Ani cun Pamhnama mawng ngthungtak pyenki, Ngmüimkhyaa kyaki. Khawmdek khyange naw ani am hmu lü am ami ksinga phäh, ani am doei khawh u. Cunüng pi nami hlawnga ve lü nami k’uma xüngkia kyase, nangmi naw ta ani nami ksingki. </char><verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ka ceh be üng namimät ka ning hawihin khaia käh ngai ua. Nami veia ka law be khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/><char style="wj">“Asäng üng khawmdek naw am na hmu ti; cunsepi nangmi naw ta nami na hmu khai. Kei ka xüngseikia kyase, nangmi pi nami xüng hnga khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/><char style="wj">“Acuna mhnüp a pha law üng, kei Pa üng ka ve, nangmi kei üng nami ve ja kei nangmi üng ka ve nami ksing khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Au pi ka ngthumkhäne jah yah lü, jah läklamki cun kei na mhläkphyanaki ni. Kei na mhläkphyanaki naküt ka Pa naw mhläkphya na khai. Kei naw pi ani mhläkphya na lü kamät ami veia ka ngdang khai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Judah (Judah Iskarot am niki) naw, “Bawipa aw, khawmdeka veia am mdan lü, keimia veia namät na mdan vai cun ihawkba ni?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Kei na mhläkphyanaki naw ka ngthu läklam se, ka Pa naw ani mhläkphya na khai. Ka Pa ja kei a veia law ni lü ani am kani ve khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/><char style="wj">“Au pi, kei am na kphyanaki naw ka ngthu am läklam; ngthu nami ngjake hin kamäta ngthu am ni, Pa na tüi lawkia ngthua kyaki.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nami hlawnga ka ve ham vei ahin he ka ning jah mthehki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/><char style="wj">“Ning jah Kpüikpak khai, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim, Pa naw ka ngming üng tüih law khai. Ani naw ahmäi ning jah mthei lü, nami veia ka pyen naküt ning jah sümsak be khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Dimdeihnak ka ning jah tak hütki; kamäta dimdeihnak ka ning jah peki. Khawmdek naw a peta mäiha ka ning jah peki am ni. Käh cäicing, pukse kyühkyawk ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/><char style="wj">‘Atuh cit kyaw ngü sepi, nami veia ka law be khai’ ka ning jah mtheh nami ngjaki. Nami na kphyanak üng ta Paa veia ka ceh vaia phäh nami je khai. Isetiakyaküng, Pa cun keia kthaka hlüngtai bawkia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/><char style="wj">“Ahin a thawnhlawk law üng, nami jumnak vaia; ahin am a thawnhlawk law ham üng, atuh ka ning jah mthehki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek Ukia Mdek bawipa pha law hlükia kyase, khawvei am ning jah ngthuheipüi thei nawng. Ani naw keia khana khyaihnak isüm am ta.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi kei naw Pa ka kphyanaki, Pa naw a na mtheha mäiha ka pawh ti khawmdek naw a ksing vaia phäh ni.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Tho law u, hin üngka naw mi cit vai u.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh cun capyit ngsun kcang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kei Capyit ngsun kcang ni, ka Pa cun ngvawng kbia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/><char style="wj">“Ani naw kei üng am ngtheipaikia kphyem naküt cun ksawm pat lü xawtki, am ngtheipai naküt cun khek lü pawhki. Acunüng ngcingcaih lü a ngtheipai law dämdäm vaia ksekpaih khawiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mtheimthang naw tuh hin ning jah ngcingcaihsak päng ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/><char style="wj">“Kei üng ngphungmanei u, kei pi nangmi üng ka ngmanei khai. Akpyeng cun a phung üng am a ngphunei üng, amät am a ngtheipai khawha mäiha, nangmi pi kei üng am ngphuneiki cun am ngtheipai thei.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kei hin Capyit ngsun ni, nangmi cun a kphyengma nami kyaki. Kei üng ngphuneikie veia kei pi ngphunei be ngü se, khawkäna ngtheipai khai; keia kaa i am pawh khawh uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/><char style="wj">“Kei üng am ngphunmaneikie cun khyawngkia akpyenga mäiha xawtin vaia kyaki. Acukba a kphyem cun mkhäm lü mei üng mkhihin u se, mei naw jah ui khawiki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi kei üng ve u lü ka ngthu nangmi üng a ve üng, nami hlüei naküt nami täsam üng nami yah khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/><char style="wj">“Ka Paa hlüngtainak cun khawkäna nami ngtheipainak naw mdanki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/><char style="wj">“Pa naw a na kphyanaka mäiha ka ning jah kphyanaki. Ka kphyanaka kea xüngsei ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/><char style="wj">“Ka Paa ngthupete jah läklam lü a kphyanaka kea ka vea kba, ka ngthupete nami jah läklam üng, ka mhläkphyanaka kea nami ve khai. </char><verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kei naw ning jah je na ngü se, nami jenak a kümcei vaia phäha ahin he ka ning jah mtheh ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Jn 5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Hin hin ka ngthupeta kyaki: kei naw ka ning jah kphyanaka kba mat ja mat mhläkphya na ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/><char style="wj">“Na püi hea phäh mhläkphyanak akyäp säih ta, amimia phäh na sak na pet hin ni. </char> <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/><char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mtheh naküt nami läklam üng ka püi hea nami kya khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/><char style="wj">“Mpyaea am ning jah sui ti nawng. A mahpa naw a bilawh cen mpya naw am ksing khawi. ‘Ka püi he aw’ ti lü ka ning jah khüki. Isetiakyaküng, Paa veia ka ngjak naküt ka ning jah mtheha phäh kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw kei cun nami na xü am ni, kei naw va ka ning jah xüki. Cit lü khawkäna pungpyah ngtheipai lü käh thuuih theikia ngtheipaia nami kya khaia ka ning jah mcawnki. Ka ngming üng Paa veia nami täsam naküt ning jah pe khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/><char style="wj">“Mat naw mat nami mhläkphyanak vaia phäh ka ning jah mtheh ni.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khawmdeka hnengnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khawmdek naw a ning jah hneng üng, nangmi am a ning jah hneng ham üng kei na hneng pängki ti ksing ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek üng nami sängei üng, khawmdek naw ning jah jawng na khai. Cunüngpi, kei naw khawmdek üngka naw ning jah xü ngü se, khawmdek üng am sängei uki. Acunakyase, khawmdek naw ning jah hnengki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mt 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Lk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Mpya cun a bawia kthaka däm bawka thum am ve,’ ti ka ning jah mtheh cen süm ua. Khyang he naw ami na mkhuimkha üng, nangmi pi ning jah mkhuimkha khaie. Ka khyübe ami ngaih üng, nangmia pyen pi ning jah ngai khaie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/><char style="wj">“Cunüngpi ka khyangea nami thawna phäh, khyange naw ahin he nami khana jah pawh law acun he. Isenitiüng, na tüi lawki am ami ksinga phäh kyaki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/><char style="wj">“Kei naw law lü am ka jah mtheha ta, mkhyekatnak am ksing khaie sü. Tuh ta ami mkhyenaka phäh ami lätnak vai lam am ve ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/><char style="wj">“Kei na hnengki naküt cun ka Pa pi hnengkia kyaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/><char style="wj">“U naw pi am a pawh khawie ami maa am ka jah pawha ta, mkhyenak am ksing khaie sü. Tuh ta ka pawhe jah hmu u lü, kei ja ka Pa jah hnengkie ni. </char> <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Sal 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Acunakyase, “Amdanga na hnengkie ni,” ti ami Thum üng ng’yuki cun kümcei law khaia kya kungki ni.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Jah Kpüikpak khai Ngmüimkhya law khai. Ani naw Pamhnama mawng ngthungtak pyen lü, Pa üngka naw lawkia kyaki. Ani cun kei naw Pa üngka naw ka tüi law khai, ani naw ka mawng pyen hü khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/><char style="wj">“Nangmi naw pi keia mawng nami pyen acun he. Isetiakyaküng ta akcük ma säih üngkhyüh ka hlawnga nami awmki hea kyaki.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nami jumeinak käh nami hawih vaia ka ning jah mthehki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/><char style="wj">“Sinakokea k’um üngkhyüh ning jah ksät khaie. Ning jah hnimki naw Pamhnama khut ka pawki ti lü ami ngaihnaka kcün pha law khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/><char style="wj">“Amimi naw Pa am ksing u, kei pi am na ksingkiea kya se, nami khana acukba pawh law khaie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/><char style="wj">“Akcün a pha law üng, ahlana ka ning jah mtheh päng ti cun nami süm vaia tuh ka ning jah mthehki.</char></para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Ngmüimkhya ngcima khut</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">
    <char style="wj">Nami hlawnga ka ve hama phäh ahin he ahlana am ning jah mtheh khawi nawng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/><char style="wj">“Atuh na tüi lawkia veia ka cit khai. Nangmi üng u naw pi, ‘Hawia na cit khai?’ ti lü am na kthäh uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/><char style="wj">“Ahin ka pyen nami ngjaka phäh aktäa nami pukseki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: ka ceh hin nami phäha daw bawki ni; am ka ceh üng ning jah Kpüikpak khai am law khaia kyaki. Ka ceh üng va nami veia ani ka tüi law khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/><char style="wj">“Ani a law üng, khawmdek khyangea mkhyenaka mawng ami ksing mkhye ja, akdaw ami pawh ja Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnaka mawng cun jah mdan law khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/><char style="wj">“Kei am ami na juma phäh, mkhyenaka mawng ami ksing cun khyekia kyaki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/><char style="wj">“Kei ka Paa veia cit be ngü se am ami na hmuh tia phäh, akdaw pawh vai am ksing u.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/><char style="wj">“Khawmdek upki cun naw ngthumkhyahnak khamei pängkia kyase, ngthumkhyahnak naw ami mkhyenak ngdangsaki. </char><verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ka ning jah mtheh vai khawhah ve sepi, atuha nangmi naw am ksing päih khawh uki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, Pamhnama mawng ngthungtak pyenki Ngmüimkhya a pha law üng, ani naw lam ning jah msüm khai. Amäta ana sumei lü pyen khai am ni. Ahmäi a ngjak pyen lü malama pha law khaie pi ning jah mtheh khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/><char style="wj">“Keia pyen naküt cun nangmi üng ning jah mtheh be khaia kyase, kei cun ani naw na mhlünmtai khai. </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/><char style="wj">“Paa ka naküt cun keia kaa kyaki. Acunakyase, kei naw ka mtheh naküt cun Ngmüimkhya naw nangmi üng ning jah mtheh be khai.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Puksetnak ja Jekyainak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Asängca üng nangmi naw kei am na hmu ti u lü, asängca bä üng nami na hmu be khai”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Axüisawe avang naw, “I a pyen hlünak ni? <char style="wj">‘Asängca üng am mi hmu u lü, asängca bä üng mi hmu be khai,’ </char>a ti ja, <char style="wj">‘Paa veia ka cit khaia kyase’ a ti hin i ni</char>, ti lü mat ja mat ngthähkie. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>“<char style="wj">‘Asängca’ </char>a ti hin i a ti ni? A ngthu pyena suilam am ksing ve u ngü” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Kthähkhyah hlükie ti Jesuh naw ksing lü, <char style="wj">“Asängca üng nangmi naw kei am na hmu ti u lü, asängca bä üng nami na hmu be khai’ ti lü, ka pyen namimät nami ngthähkie aw? </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: nangmi kyap lü nami mbawi khaie, khawmdek ta jekyai khai. Nami pukse khai, cunüngpi nami puksetnak cun jenaka ngläüh khai.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/><char style="wj">“Nghnumi a ca law hlü üng pukse khawiki. Isetiakyaküng, a huiheinak vaia kcün cäh lawkia kyase ni. Cunüngpi naca hmi lawki a hmuh ja a huihei naküt mhnihinki. Isetiakyaküng, naca cun khawmdek khana a hmi law pänga phäh jekyainak am beki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/><char style="wj">“Tukbäih nangmi pi nami pukseki; acunsepi ning jah hmu be ngü se jenak am nami kümcei khai. Nami mlung jenak am be se, u naw käh ning jah hutei khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Acuna mhnüp üng nangmi naw i pi am na kthäh ti uki. Akcanga ka ning jah mthehki: Paa veia ahmäi ka ngming am nami täsam naküt Pa naw ning jah pe khai. </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/><char style="wj">“Tuh vei cäpa ka ngming üng i am tä ham uki; nami jenaka kümceinak vaia täsam ua, nami yah khai.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khawmdek ka näng päng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ahina ngthu msuimcäpnak am ka ning jah mtheh pängki. Msuimcäpnak üng am ning jah mtheh lü Paa mawng angsinga ka ning jah mtheh vaia kcün cun pha law khai. </char> <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/><char style="wj">“Acuna mhnüp apha law üng, ka ngming üng ania veia nami ktaiyü khai; Pa veia nami kcaha ka ning jah ktaiyü pet khai am ti nawng;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/><char style="wj">“Isetiakyaküng, nangmi naw kei na mhläkphya na u lü, kei Pa üngka naw ka lawki ti nami jumkia kyase Pa naw pi ning jah mhläkphyanaki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/><char style="wj">“Kei, Pa üngka naw law lü, khawmdek khana ka lawki. Khawmdek ceh ta lü Paa veia ka cit be khaia kyaki” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he naw, “Tenga, tuh ta msuimcäpnak kaa angsinga ngthu pyen veki. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>“Nang naw ahmäi na ksingki, u naw ani kthäh vai am hlü ve ti atuh kami ksingki he. Ahina phäha Pamhnam üngka naw na lawki ti jum ve ung” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Tuh mä nami jum?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/><char style="wj">“Teng u, akcün pha law hlüki, pha law päng ve. Acuna kcün üng kei kamät däk na hawih u lü, nami im phähphäha nami dawng be khaie. Acunsepi, Pa ka hlawnga vekia kyase kamät däk am ve nawng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/><char style="wj">“Kei üngkhyüh dimdeihnak nami yah vaia ahin ka ning jah mtheh päng ni. Khawmdek naw ning jah mkhuimkha khai. Cunsepi, linglai lü ve ua. Kei naw khawmdek ka näng päng ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Axüisawe phäh Jesuh ktaiyüki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Acuna ngthu a pyen law käna Jesuh khana mang lü, <char style="wj">“Ka Pa aw, akcün pha law päng ve. Capa naw a ning mhlünmtai law vaia, na Capa mhlünmtaia.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/><char style="wj">Acukba khyange naküta khana khyaibahnak a na pet am, na peta khyang naküt üng angsäia xünnak a jah pet khawh vaia.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/><char style="wj">“Angsäia xünnak hin ta, nang Pamhnam kcang däk ja na tüi law Jesuh Khritaw ksingnak cen ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/><char style="wj">“Ka pawh vaia khut na na pet mcän lü, khawmdek khana ka ning mhlünmtai pängki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/><char style="wj">“Aw ka Pa aw, khawmdek am a ngtüi ham üng nang am atänga hlüngtainak ka yah cen atuh pi na hmai maa na pe bea.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Khawmdek üngka jah xü lü na na jah petea veia na ngming ka jah mtheh päng ni. Amimi na jah kaa kyase, kei üng na na jah pet päng ni. Amimi naw na ngthukhyü pi läklamkie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/><char style="wj">“Na na jah pet naküt cun nang üngka naw lawki ti ksing päng ve u.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/><char style="wj">“Na na jah peta ngthue pi ka jah pet; acun dokhamei u lü nang üngka naw ka lawki ti angsinga ksing ve u. Nang naw na na tüi law ti pi jumkie.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ami phäha ktaiyü veng. Khawmdeka phäha am ktaiyü nawng. Nang naw na na jah pete na kaa ami kyaa phäha, hinea phäha ni ka ktaiyü ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/><char style="wj">“Ka kaa naküt cun na ka ni, na ka naküt cun pi ka kaa kyaki. Keia hlüngtainak cun acune üngkhyüh ngdang ve.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/><char style="wj">“Acunüng, na veia ka law khaia kyase, kei khawmdek khana am ve ti nawng. Hine hin khawmdeka khana ve hüt khaie. Ngcingcaihkia ka Pa aw, nini pumata ni kyaa mäiha, amimi pi pumata ami kya thei vaia, na na peta na ngming jomah am jah kcungvawnga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sal 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jn 13:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ami hlawnga ka vea küt üng, na na peta na ngming jomah am ka jah kcungvawng khawiki. Cangcim a küm lawnak vaia, khyükia capa mata thea, u pi am khyük khaia ka jah kcungvawng ni. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/><char style="wj">“Acunsepi, tukbäih na veia ka law khaia kyase, hine naw keia jenak ami mlung k’uma kümkawikia ami yahei vaia phäh, kei naw hina ngthu khawmdek khana ka ve ham üng ka pyen ni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/><char style="wj">“Na ngthu ka jah peki; acunüng, kei khawmdek üng am ka sängeia mäiha, amimi pi khawmdek üng am sängei u se, khawmdek naw jah hnengki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/><char style="wj">“Ahin he khawmdek khan üngka naw na jah lak be vaia ka täsamki am ni. Khawyaipaa kut üngkhyüh na jah yungkaih vaia na veia ka täsamki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/><char style="wj">“Kei khawmdek üng am ka sängeia mäiha, amimi pi khawmdek üng am sängei u.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/><char style="wj">“Amimi, ngthungtak am jah ngcimcaihsaka, na ngthu cun ngthungtaka pi kyaki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/><char style="wj">“Nang naw kei khawmdeka na na tüiha mäiha, kei naw pi amimi ka jah tüihki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/><char style="wj">“Amimi akcanga na veia ami ng’apei law vaia phäh, kei ami phäha kamät na veia ka ng’apeiki.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hinea phäh däka ka ktaiyüki am ni, hinea ngthu pyena phäh kei na jum law khaiea phäha pi ka ktaiyüki. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/><char style="wj">“Ami yümmat law vaia ka ktaiyüki. Pa aw, nang kei üng ve lü kei nang üng ka vea mäiha, amimi pi nini üng ve law u se. Amimi ami yümmat üng va, khawmdek khyange naw na na tüi law ti cun jum law khaie.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/><char style="wj">“Nang ja kei pumsa mata ni thawna mäiha amimi pi pumsa mata ami thawn thei vaia; hlüngtainak na na pet cen ka jah peki.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/><char style="wj">“Kei amimi üng ve lü, nang kei üng veki se, amimi ami yümmat law vaia phäh. Acunüng va, na na tüih law ja na na mhläkphyanaka mäiha, na jah mhläkphyanaki ti cun khawmdek khyange naw ksing law khaie.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ka Pa aw, khawmdek am a ngtüi ham üng na mhläkphya na lü na na peta hlüngtainak cen, ka venaka ve u lü keia hlüngtainak ami hmu thei vaia hlüei veng. </char> <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/><char style="wj">“Ngsungpyunkia Pa aw, khawmdek naw am ni ksing. Kei naw ta ni ksing veng; hine naw pi na na tüi law ti ksingki he.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/><char style="wj">“Ka hama na taka mhläkphyanak cen amimi üng ve se, kei pi amimi üng ka ve vaia, ami veia na ngming ka jah ksingsaki, ka jah ksingsak ham lä khai”</char> ti lü ktaiyüki.<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami man </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Jesuh ktaiyü law päng se axüisaw he am Kidron Lawngca caye da va citkie. Acuna hnüna ngvawng veki, acun üng axüisaw he am atänga lutkie. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Jesuh cun axüisaw he am acuna hnüna khawvei cit khawikiea kyase, cengkia Judah Iskarot naw acuna hnün cun ksingki. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Judah ngvawng da citki. Romah yekape, ktaiyü ngvaie ja Pharisee naw ami jah tüi law Temple ngängkia khyange avang jah lawpüi se, mthikcime, meiim ja ngtukmei jah kawteikie cun acuia a jah lawpüi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Jesuh naw a khana pha law khai naküt jah ksingei lü, va cit lü, <char style="wj">“U nami suiki ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Amimi naw, “Nazaret Jesuh,” ni ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acun cun kei ni”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Cengkia Judah pi ami ksunga ngdüi hngaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acun cun kei ni” </char>a ti ja, ami hnua ngnawn u lü mdeka kyukie. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“U nami suiki ni?”</char> ti lü a jah kthäh betü.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Amimi naw, “Nazaret Jesuh” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Acun cun kei ni, ti lü ka ning jah mtheh päng; kei nami na suikia a kyak üng akce he cit u se”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>(Acun cun, <char style="wj">“Nang naw na na jah pet mat pi käh ka mkhyüh khai ni”</char> ti lü a ngthu pyen akümnak vaia kyaki.)<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Sihmon Pita naw kcim a kbahei kset lü Ktaiyü Ngvai säiha mpyaa nghnga khet da a ksawm pat. Acuna mpyaa ngming cun Malakhuha kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mt 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Lk 22:42</ref></char></note>Jesuh naw Pita üng, <char style="wj">“Kcim a im üng xawn bea; ka Pa naw a na peta khuikhatnak khawt hin am ka aw khai aw?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Anna veia ami cehpüi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Acunüng, Romah yekape ja Temple ngängkia Judah khyange naw Jesuh man u lü, khitkie naw, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Annaa veia ami cehpüi ma u. Anna cun acuna kum üng Ktaiyü Ngvaisäih Kaiphaha pupua kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Jn 11:49</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref></char></note>Kaiphah cun, “Khyang khawhaha phäh khyang mat a thih daw bawki” ti lü, Judah ngvaie jah mthehkia khyanga kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw Jesuh a ma </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mt 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Lk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Sihmon Pita ja axüisaw he üngka mat naw Jesuh läki xawi. Acuna axüisaw üngka mat cun Ktaiyü Ngvaisäih naw ksingki; Ktaiyü Ngvai säiha im ngvawng mkawt k’uma Jesuh am lutki xawi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Acunsepi Pita cun khawkpung mkawt peia ngdüiki. Acunüng axüisaw kce mat va nghlat be lü mkawt ksawh ngängki nghnumica kthäh lü Pita a luh lawpüi. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Mkawt ksawh ngängkia nghnumica naw Pita üng, “Nang pi ania xüisawa am na kyaki aw?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">“Am ni nawng” Pita naw a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Khawsikia kyase, mpyae ja Romah yekape naw mei tik lü ngdüi lü mei omkie. Pita pi ami hlawnga va ngdüi lü mei awmei hngaki.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ktaiyü ngvaisäih naw Jesuh a kthäh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mt 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Lk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Ktaiyü Ngvaisäih naw axüisaw hea mawng ja a jah mtheia mawng Jesuh üng a kthäh. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Jesuh naw msang lü, <char style="wj">“Ngthu ka pyen üng khyanga hmuh ngjaka va ka pyenki. Sinakok ja Judahea ami ngbumnak Templea ka jah mthei khawiki, khyange pi ngcun lawkie, ampyua i am pyen khawi nawng.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/><char style="wj">“Ise na na kthäh ni? Ami veia ka ngthu pyena mawng cun ka ngthu ngjakie jah kthäha; acune naw i ka pyen ksingki he” </char>a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Acun a pyen üng a peia ngdüiki, yekap mat naw Jesuh kbei lü, “Ktaiyü Ngvaisäih ahikba na msangki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka pyen mkhye a ve üng ahin üng veki naküt üng jah mtheha. Ka pyen cangki ani üng, ise na na kbeiki ni?”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Acunüng Anna naw Jesuh a ngkhihnak mahmaha Ktaiyü Ngvaisäih Kaiphah a veia a tüih.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pita naw Jesuh a ma betü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mt 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Lk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Sihmon Pita ngdüi lü mei om ham se, khyang kce he naw, “Nang pi ania xüisawa am na kyaki aw?” ami ti üng,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">“Am ni nawng,” ti lü, ngcim betüki.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ktaiyü Ngvai säiha a mpya Pita naw a nghnga a ksawm pata a mjükphyüi mat naw, “Ani am ngvawnga ve niki se ka ning jah hmuh am ni mä?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Pita a ngcim betü ja; ainghlüi khawngki.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilata maa Jesuha ngdüihnak </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11">11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Khawa ngawi law üng, Jesuh Kaiphaha im üngkhyüh sangpuxanga Bawingawhnaka ami cehpüi u. Judah ngvaie cun sangpuxanga Bawingawhnaka am lut u. Lätnak Pawi buh ami einak thei vaia, ngcingcaihnak am amimät ami ve vaia phäh kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Acunüng, Pilat akpunga lut law lü, “Hina khana i nami mkatnak ve se aw?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Amimi naw, “Hin hin khyangkaa am a ni üng na veia am lawpüi sawxat u nawng” ti lü ami msang.<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilat naw, “Namimät naw cehpüi u lü, nami thuma kba cijang ua,” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Judah mkhawnge naw, “Kami ngaiha u hnim vaia thum am ve” ami ti. <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note>(Acun cun a thih vaia mawng Jesuh naw a pyena mäiha akümnak law vaia kyaki.)<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilat naw Bawingawhnaka lut be lü Jesuh khüki naw, “Nang Judahea sangpuxanga na kyaki aw?” ti lü a kthäh.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Hina ngthu hin namäta mlung üngka naw lut lawki aw. Am ani üng ka mawngma khyange naw ning mtheh u se na pyen aw?” </char>ti lü a kthäh be.<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilat naw, “Kei Judah khyanga na ngaih aw? Namäta khyang mjüe ja ktaiyü ngvaie naw ka kut üng ami na msum lawa na kyaki. Ia mkhyenak na pawh ni?” ti lü a msang.<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka khaw ta hina khawmdek üng am sängei; ka khaw hin hina khawmdek üng a sängei vai sü ta ka hnukläke naw Judah ngvaiea kut üngkhyüh na yung khaie sü; ka khaw hin hina khawmdeka am ni”</char> ti lü a pyen.<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilat naw, “Acunüng, nang sangpuxang aw?” ti se,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ä, na pyena mäiha kei sangpuxang ni. Ka hmi lawnak ja khawmdek khana ka lawnak hin ngthungtak saksinak vaia phäha kyaki. Au pi ngthungtak üng sängeiki naküt naw ka ngthu ngaiki”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilat naw Jesuh üng, “Ngthungtak cun i ni?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jesuh hnim vaia mkhyäp </para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mt 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Acuna ngthu a pyen päng ja Judahea veia cit lü, “Thihnak awng vaia mkhyenak ani üng am hmu veng, <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>acunsepi Lätnak Pawi k’um üng thawng kyum mat ka ning jah mhlät pet vaia thum nami taki. Acunakyase, Judahea sangpuxang hin ka ning jah mhlät pet vaia nami ngaiki aw?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Amimi naw ngpyang u lü, “Ani käh mhläta. Barabah jah mhlät peta” ami ti. (Barabah cun mawa ve lü kcim kcei bikia mpyukeia kyaki.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Acunüng, Pilat naw Jesuh cehpüi lü a kpaih. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Yekape naw nghling lukhüm pyang u lü ami ngbüngsak. Acun käna, jih sennu ngvüihsak u lü, <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>a peia law u lü, “Judahea Sangpuxang, xüng soa” ti lü a hmai ami kbeih.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilat naw lut law betü lü, “Teng u, thih vai awnga mkhyenak i pi am hmu nawng ti nami ksing vaia, nami veia ka lawpüi beki” a ti. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Jesuh cun nghling lukhüm ngbüng lü jih sennu pi ngvaih lü kpunga lut lawki. Pilat naw, “Teng u, hina khyang” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie ja Temple ngänge naw ami hmu ja, “Kutlamktung üng taiha, kutlamktung üng taiha” ti lü ngpyangkie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilat naw, “Nangmi naw cehpüi u lü, kutlamktung üng taih ua; kei naw ta thih awng vai a mkhyenak am hmu veng” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Judahe naw, “Pamhnama Capaa mhnüneikia kyase, kami thuma tia kba, thi khaia nglawi ve” ti lü ami msang.<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilat naw acun a ngjak ja kyühei law dämdäm lü, <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>a Bawingawhnaka cit be lü, “Nang hawia ka naw na lawki ni?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Jesuh naw mkhap mat am pi am msang be. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilat naw, “Am na na msang hlüki aw? Ning khyah be vai ja kutlamktung üng ning taih vai hin keia mkhyaha kya khai, ti cun ksinga” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Pamhnam naw a ning pet pänga phäh däk ni, ka khana khyaibahnak na tak ve. Acunakyase, kei hin na veia ning msum lawki cen mkhyekatnak akdäm bawk pawhki ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilat naw acun a ngjak üngkhyüh Jesuh a mhlät vaia lam suiki. Acunsepi Judahe naw ngpyang u lü, “Hina khyang na mhlät üng Emperoa püia käh na kya khai. Sangpuxanga mhnüneiki naküt cun Emperoa yee ni” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilat naw acun a ngjak ja Jesuh luh lawpüi lü, Hebru läk am Kabbata ami ti Ngthumkhyahnak Lungsüma khana ngawki. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Acuna mhnüp cun Lätnak Pawi am a pha ham mhnüp mat a hlüa mhnüpa; mhnüp ngsunga kyase, Pilat naw Judahea veia, “Teng u, nami sangpuxang” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Amimi naw ngpyang u lü, “Hnima, hnima, mkhyüha, kutlamktung üng taiha” ami ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilat naw, “Nami sangpuxang, kutlamktung üng ka taih vai nami hlüeiki aw?” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ktaiyü ngvaie naw, “Emperoa thea sangpuxang akce am ta u nawng” ti lü, ami msang.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Acunüng, Pilat naw Jesuh cun kutlamktung üng taih vaia a jah msum.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Jesuh kutlamktung üng tai h</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Jesuh cun ami cehpüi. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Jesuh naw amäta phäha kutlamktung kawt lü ‘Luyuh Hnün’ ami ti, Hebru läk am Kolkothaa citki. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Acuia kutlamktung üng khyang nghngih am ami jah taih yüm. A peia mat cim jah taih u lü Jesuh anglung üng ami taih. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilat naw, “Nazaret Jesuh, Judahea Sangpuxang” ti lü kca yuk lü kutlamktung khana a taih. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Jesuh kutlamktung üng ami taihnaka hnün cun Jerusalem mlüha peia kyaki. Acuna kca cun Hebru, Latin ja Krik läke üng ami yuka kyase Judah khyang khawhah naw khekie. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Ktaiyü ngvaie naw Pilat aw, “Judahea Sangpuxang” ti lü käh yuka, “Kei, Judahea Sangpuxang ni, ti ve” ti lü yuka’” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilat naw, “Ka yuk päng cen ka yuka kba ve se” ti lü a jah msang.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Yekape naw kutlamktung khana Jesuh ami taih päng üng a suisake jah lo u lü, kphyüa ktek u lü mat cima ami ng’yatei. Ak’uma a phyang jih cun am xüi u, alu üngka naw ale cäpa taha kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sal 22:18</ref></char></note>Yekape naw, “Käh mi ktek vai, u naw a bi vai cungkek mi kphawng vai u” ami ti. Acun cun Pamhnama cangcim üng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Ka suisake jah ng’yetei u lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ka kcu nglünglawknak khaie ni” ti a küm lawnak vaia kyaki.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Acun cun yekape naw ami pawha kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Jesuha kutlamktung peia, Jesuha nu ja Kalawphaa a khyu Marih ja Marih Makdalin ngdüikie. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Jesuh naw a nu ja a kphyanak axüisaw a peia ngdüi ni se jah hmu lü, a nu üng, <char style="wj">“Na capa ta ani ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Axüisaw üng, <char style="wj">“Ani ni na nu”</char> a ti. Acunüng tün lü, acuna axüisaw naw Jesuha nu cun a ima a cehpüi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh thihnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sal 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char>
    </note>Acunkäna, atuh ta ahmäi naküt kümcei pängki ti Jesuh naw ksing lü, cangcima kümnak vaia, <char style="wj">“Tui cawi veng”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Acuia Capyitui kpaih k’am mat ami tak. Hisop Capyitui k'am üng kphum lü cung üng taihkie naw a mpyawng üng ami jeng sun. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Jesuh naw Capyitui kpaih a awk päng ja <char style="wj">“Ngpäng ve”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Acunüng, a ngmüm üng a sak päihki.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuha kpem kcei am sun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Judah ngvaie naw kutlamktung üng ami taiha khaw jah k'ek lü, ami yawke ami jah khyak vaia Pilat ami kthäh. Isenitiüng, acuna mhnüp cun Amhma mhnüpa kyaki. Angawi Sabbath mhnüp (Lawkia Sabbath mhnüp cun Judahea thuma aktäa ngcingcaihkia mhnüpa kyaki) üng ami yawke kutlamktung üng a ngtaihei vai am jum u. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Yekape law u lü Jesuh am atänga ami jah taih yüm xawia ani khawe cun ami jah k’ek. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Acunsepi, Jesuha veia ami law üng, Jesuh thi pängki ti ksing u lü a khawe am jah k’ek u. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Acunsepi yekape üngka mat naw Jesuha kpem kcei am a sun. Acunüng thi ja tui ngsawi law yümki xawi. (<verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Hmuki mat naw pyen lü ngsingsak pängki. A ngsingsak pi cangki. Nami jum vaia a ngthu pyen cangki ti pi ani naw ksing lawki.) <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Ex 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Num 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Sal 34:20</ref></char></note>Acun cun, “A yuh mat pi käh ek khai” ti lü, Cangcima a küm lawnak vaia kyaki. <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakh 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Malam 1:7</ref> </char></note>Acuna thea cangcim naw, “Khyange naw kcei am a kpem ami sun cun hmu khaie” pi Cangcim naw ti hamki.<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ami k’ut nak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Acunkäna Arimahte mlüha ka Josep, Jesuha axüisaw, acunsepi Judah ngvaie a jah kyüha phäh, ampyua veki. Ani naw Jesuha yawk a cehpüi vaia Pilat kthäh se, Pilat naw a khyah. Josep naw law lü Jesuha a yawk cun a cehpüi. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note>Ahlana mthana Jesuha veia lawkia Nikawdim naw mura ng'ui ja aloe jah kcaw, khin mku bang cehpüi lü Josep am citki xawi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Jesuha yawk cun lo ni lü Judahea ami ng’utei khawia thuma, mura ng’ui ja jih am ani hlawp. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Kutlamktung üng ami taihnaka peia ngvawng mat veki. Acuna ngvawng üng u pi am ami k’utnak khawia lungdü kthai mat veki. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Angawi cun Judahea Sabbath mhnüpa kya lü, lungdü ng'etkia kyase, acun üng Jesuh ami k’ut.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Jesuh tho beki </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mt 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Ngpum mhnüp khawa nghmüp ham üng, Marih Makdalin cun lungdüa cit lü ng’utnak ami khaihnak lungnu a na ngpyawtei se a hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Sihmon Pita ja Jesuha mhlänak axüisaw kcea veia dawng lü, “Ng’utnak üngka naw Bawipa cehpüi ve u, hawia ami tak am ksing veng” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Acunüng,Pita ja axüisaw kce lungdüa citki xawi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Nghngih cun dawngki xawi; axüisaw mat naw Pita khe lü lungdüa a na pha maki. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Ngmüm lü a teng üng, hlawpnak jih däk ve se a hmuh; acunsepi ak’uma am lut. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Sihmon Pita naw pi hnua pha law lü, ng’utnak k’uma a luh üng hlawpnak jih ja, <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>a lu ami hlawpnak kpyawn cun a hmuh. A pum hlawpnaka jihea hlawnga am ve lü, a pum hlawpnak cun amät ngtawmei hnga se a hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Axüisaw kce dawng lü lungdü pha maki naw pi lut hnga lü hmu lü jumki. (<verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Thihnak üngkhyüh tho be khai tia cangcim üng veki cun axüisaw he naw am ksing u.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Acunüng, axüisaw he cun animäta ima nghlat beki xawi.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marih Makdalina veia Jesuh ngdangki </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mt 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Marih cun lungdüa peia kyap lü ngdüiki; a kyah sawa ngmüm lü ng’utnaka k’um cun a juk teng; <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>khankhawngsä nghngih jih kbawk suisa ni lü Jesuha yawka peia mat a lu da, mat a khaw da ngaw ni se a jah hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Anini naw, “Nghnumi aw, ise na kyapki ni?” ti lü Marih ani kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Marih naw, “Ka Bawipa cehpüi ve u, ami taknak am ksing veng” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Acukba a pyen päng ja, a hnu da nghlat lü Jesuh ngdüi se a hmuh. Acunsepi Jesuh hman tia am ksing. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nghnumi aw, ise na kyapki ni? U na suiki ni?”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Marih naw ngvawng mtäta ngai lü, “Nang naw ani ahin üngkhyüh na cehpüi a ni üng na taknak na mtheha. Cit lü ka lak be vaia” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Marih”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Marih naw nghlat lü Hebru läk am, “Raboni” a ti; (Acun cun Saja aw, tinaka kyaki.)<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Käh na mana; Paa veia am kai be ham nawng. Ka naea venaka cit lü ka Paa kyakia nami Pa, Ka Pamhnama kyakia nami Pamhnam ania veia ka kai be vaia mawng jah va mtheha”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Acunüng Marih Makdalin cun axüisaw hea veia cit lü, Bawipa a hmuh ja ngthu a mthehea mawng pi a jah mtheh.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Axüisawea veia Jesuh ngdangki </para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Ngpum mhnüp mü lama, Judah ngvaie ami jah kyüha phäh ksawh khai u lü, axüisaw he ngbumnakie. Ami ngbumnaka Jesuh law lü, ami ksunga ngdüi lawki naw, <char style="wj">“Nami khana dimdeihnak ve se” </char>a ti. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Acukba pyen päng lü, a kut ja a kpem a jah mhnuh. Axüisawe naw Bawipa ami hmuh ja aktäa jekie. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nami khana dimdeihnak ve se; Pa naw a na tüiha mäiha ka ning jah tüihki”</char> a ti betü. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Acunkäna ami khana khawkhi hmut lü, <char style="wj">“Ngmüimkhya Ngcim doei ua.</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mt 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Khyang hea mkhyenak nami mhlät naküt cun mhläta kya khai; am nami jah mhlät üng jah mhläta am kya”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Thomah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Jesuh a law üng, xaleinghngihe üngka (Angphia ami sui) Thomah cun ami hlawnga am ve. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Acunakyase, axüisaw kce he naw, “Bawipa kami hmuki” ti lü ami mtheh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Thomah naw, “Ami hnennaka a kut nghma am hmu lü, hnennak anghma ka kut pyün üng am mtham lü, a kpem üng hnet lü am ka mhjut üng ta, am jum thei nawng” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Pat at mhjawk lü, axüisaw he im k'uma ami ngcun be üng Thomah pi ami hlawnga ve hngaki. Ksawhe pi khai lü ami jah ken kyaw, Jesuh law lü ami nglung üng ngdüi lawki naw, <char style="wj">“Nami khana dimdeihnak pha law se”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Thomah üng, <char style="wj">“Ka kute jah mthama; ka kute pi jah tenga, na kut säng lü ka kpem hneta. Käh uplat ti lü, jum hnüha”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Thomah naw, “Ka Bawipa ja ka Pamhnama kya veki” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nang naw na na hmuha phäha na na jumki aw? Am na hmu lü na jumkie ta ihlawka ami josenki ni”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ahina caup yuka mawngma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Hina caup üng am ami yuksiha müncanksee khawhah, Jesuh naw axüisaw hea maa jah biki. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Acunsepi, Jesuh cun Mesijah, Pamhnama Capaa kyaki ti cun nami jumnak vai ja, ani nami jumnak am xünnak nami yah vaia, ahin he hin jah yuka kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Axüisawe khyüha veia Jesuha ngdangnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Acunkäna, Jesuh Tiberi Tuili pei, axüisaw hea veia ngdang betüki. Acuia a ngdang betüa mawng ta, <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Sihmon Pita, Thomah (Angphi ami ti), Natanelah (Kalile hne Kana mlüha ka), Zebedea capa xawi ja axüisaw kce xawi nghngih awmki he. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Lk 5:5</ref></char></note>Sihmon Pita naw ami vei, “Nga sui khaia ka cit khai” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Amimi naw, “Keimi pi na hlawnga kami law hnga khai” ami ti. Acunüng mlawng am citkie; acuna mthan cun ipi am yah u. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Khawmik a luh law üng, Jesuh tui kama ngdüiki. Acunsepi axüisaw he naw Jesuh hmana am ksing u. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka püi he aw, nga i pi am mbawh ham uki aw?”</char> ti lü a jah kthäh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Amimi naw, “Ipi am mbawh u ngü” ami ti.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:6">Lk 5:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Mlawng khet da ngvai vawi ua, nami yah khai ni”</char> a ti. Ami vawih üng nga khawhah yahkie. Acunüng nga nung lü ngvai am kaih be khawh u.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Jesuha mhlänak axüisaw naw Pita üng, “Bawipa va ni kbak” a ti. Bawipa a ni hman Sihmon Pita naw a ngjak üng a kcu jih be lü tui da kcoki, (Akpuma a vea phäha kyaki). <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Axüisaw kce he ngvai üng nga akbea kaih law u lü mlawng am kawng da lawkie. Kawng üngka naw lam khyukip banga thuki. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Kawng ami va pha ja acuia mei k’eh am mei ami tih, a khana nga ngxaih ja muk ve se ami hmuh u. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Nga nami mbawh api lawpüi ua”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Sihmon Pita naw mlawnga khana va kai lü nga angbaü avana phya ja mhmakip ja kthum law se, ngvai kawnga a kaih law. Acukba nung kyaw lü pi ngvai am tek. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ngawi ei, ei law ua”</char> a ti. Bawipa a ni hman ksing u lü, axüisaw he üng u naw pi, “Nang u ni?” ti lü am kthäh dat u. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Jesuh naw law lü muk lo lü a jah pet, nga pi acukba a jah pet.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Acun cun Jesuh thihnak üngkhyüh a thawh be käna axüisaw hea veia a ngdang akthumnaka kyaki.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Ngawi ei ami ei käna, Jesuh naw Sihmon Pita üng, <char style="wj">“Johana capa Sihmon, hinea na mhläkphyanaka kthaka na na mhläkphyanaki aw?”</char> a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ani naw, “Ä, Bawipa aw, ka ning kphyanak na ksingki” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka tocae jah tumcah bä”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Anghngihnaka Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Johana capa Sihmon, na na mhläkphyanaki aw?”</char> a ti betü.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Ani naw, “Ä, Ka ning mhläkphyanaki ti na ksingki” a ti be.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka toe jah mcei bä” </char>a ti. <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Akthumnaka Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Johana capa Sihmon, na na mhläkphyanaki aw?”</char> a ti betü.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jesuh naw, “Na na mhläkphyanaki aw?” ti lü kthum vei kthäh se Pita pukse law lü, “Bawipa aw, ahmäi na ksingki, ka ning kphyanak pi na ksingki” a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka toe jah tumcah bä.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/><char style="wj">“Akcanga ka ning mthehki: na dik hama kcün üng na cehnak hlü naküta na cit hü theiki. Acunsepi, na xü law üng na kut jah säng lü, khyang kce naw ning khit lü am na cehnak hlüa ning cehpüi khai”</char> a ti. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>(Acuna ngthu cun Pita naw ihawkba thi lü, Pamhnam mhlünmtai khai ti msingnaka a pyena kyaki.) Acukba a pyen käna, Jesuh naw <char style="wj">“Na läk lawa”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ja Axüisaw kce he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:25">Jn 13:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pita naw nghlat lü Jesuha mhlänak axüisaw, ahlana müei ami ei üng a peia nghlat law lü, “Bawipa aw, ning phyehei khai cun u ni?” tiki a hnua ngaw se a hmuh. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Pita naw Jesuh hmu lü, “Bawipa aw, hina khyang ihawkba vai ni?” a ti.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Jesuh naw, <char style="wj">“Ka law be veia ani a xüng vai ka hlüei üng mä, nang üng i pi am sängei. Na läk lawa”</char> a ti.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Acuna mawng cun Jesuha axüisaw hea ksunga, acuna axüisaw am thi khai” ti lü, aktäa ngthang hüki. Acunsepi, Jesuh naw acuna axüisaw am thi khai a ti am ni, <char style="wj">“Ka law be veia ani a xüng vai ka hlüei üng, nang üng i pi am sängei” </char> däk va a ti.<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Ahina mawngmae jah pyensa lü jah yukthetki cun axüisaw ni; a pyen pi cangki ti kami ksingki.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khüpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Ahina thea pi Jesuh naw a jah pawhmsah akce khawhah veki. Acun he jah yuk päih vai ani üng, acun jah yuknaka caupe khawmdek khana taknak vai am khäk khaia ka ngaiki.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
